msgid "Layers and Perimeters"
msgstr "图层和周长"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:432
msgid ""
"This setting controls the layer height used throughout the slice, except for "
"the first layer. Thinner layers give better accuracy but take more time to "
"print. When the height that fits a whole number of layers into 1 mm is a "
"repeating decimal, enter the rounded value and it is used as the exact "
"fraction, so the layers stay aligned to millimeter boundaries:\n"
"\n"
"0.3333 = 3 layers/mm\n"
"0.1667 = 6 layers/mm\n"
"0.1429 = 7 layers/mm\n"
"0.1111 = 9 layers/mm\n"
"\n"
"1, 2, 4, 5, 8, and 10 layers/mm are exact decimals and are used as entered."
msgstr ""
"此设置控制切片中所有层使用的层高度（第一层除外）。更薄的层能提供更好的精度，"
"但打印时间更长。当 1 mm 内能容纳整数层数的层高度为循环小数时，输入其四舍五入"
"值，该值将作为精确分数使用，从而使各层保持与毫米边界对齐：\n"
"\n"
"0.3333 = 3 layers/mm\n"
"0.1667 = 6 layers/mm\n"
"0.1429 = 7 layers/mm\n"
"0.1111 = 9 layers/mm\n"
"\n"
"1、2、4、5、8 和 10 layers/mm 是精确的小数，按输入值使用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:447
msgid "Color mixing base layers"
msgstr "混色基础层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:449
msgid ""
"Number of initial layers that print with a single filament instead of color-"
"mixed dither. The bottom of a print is exposed (glass beds, flipped prints) "
"and the dither pattern produces visible striping until the cycle has had "
"several layers to converge. Locking the base to one filament also keeps bed "
"adhesion uniform on the most critical layers. Set to 0 to disable and start "
"color mixing immediately on layer 1."
msgstr ""
"使用单一耗材而非混色抖动打印的起始层数。打印件底部是暴露的（玻璃热床、翻转打"
"印件），抖动图案会产生明显的条纹，直到循环经过若干层后趋于收敛。将基础层锁定"
"为单一耗材也能让最关键的几层保持均匀的热床附着。设为 0 可禁用并从第 1 层立即"
"开始混色。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:459
msgid "Color mixing base filament"
msgstr "混色基础耗材"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:461
msgid ""
"Which loaded filament to use for the color mixing base layers (see above).\n"
"• Darkest: auto-pick the darkest loaded filament. Hides any dither artifacts "
"and tends to give the cleanest-looking bottom face.\n"
"• Lightest: auto-pick the brightest loaded filament. Useful when the bottom "
"of the print should look bright or be barely visible.\n"
"• Volume default: use whatever filament the volume is otherwise assigned to. "
"Pick this if you want explicit control through the volume's extruder setting."
msgstr ""
"用于混色基础层的已加载耗材（见上文）。\n"
"• 最深色：自动选取最深的已加载耗材。可隐藏抖动瑕疵，通常使底面看起来最干"
"净。\n"
"• 最浅色：自动选取最亮的已加载耗材。适用于打印件底部应显得明亮或几乎不可见的"
"情况。\n"
"• 体积默认：使用该体积本来分配的耗材。如需通过体积的挤出机设置进行明确控制，"
"请选此项。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:469
msgid "Darkest available"
msgstr "最深可用"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:470
msgid "Lightest available"
msgstr "最浅可用"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:471
msgid "Volume default"
msgstr "体积默认"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:475
#: src/DSKY/GUI/ConfigWizard.cpp:2602
msgid "Max print height"
msgstr "最大打印高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:476
msgid ""
"Set this to the maximum height that can be reached by your extruder while "
"printing."
msgstr "将此设置为挤出头在打印时可以达到的最大高度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:484
msgid "Hostname, IP or URL"
msgstr "主机名,IP 或 URL"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:485
msgid ""
"preFlight uploads G-code to the printer host at this address. Enter a "
"hostname, an IP address or a full URL. Add the port when the host does not "
"listen on the default one, for example 192.168.1.50:7126 for a second "
"Moonraker instance or octopi.local:5000 for OctoPrint without its proxy. A "
"host behind HAProxy with basic authentication takes the user name and "
"password in the URL: https://username:password@your-host-address/"
msgstr ""
"preFlight 会将 G-code 上传到此地址的打印机主机。请输入主机名、IP 地址或完整 "
"URL。如果主机未监听默认端口，请添加端口，例如第二个 Moonraker 实例使用 "
"192.168.1.50:7126，不带代理的 OctoPrint 使用 octopi.local:5000。位于 HAProxy "
"之后并使用基本身份验证的主机需要在 URL 中包含用户名和密码：https://"
"username:password@your-host-address/"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:496
msgid "Web interface hostname, IP or URL"
msgstr "网页界面的主机名、IP 或 URL"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:497
msgid ""
"Optional. The address the Printer tab opens when the web interface is served "
"apart from Moonraker, as on a multi-instance host where Mainsail or Fluidd "
"is on port 80 and each printer's Moonraker is on 7125, 7126 and so on. Enter "
"a hostname, an IP address or a full URL, with the port when it is not the "
"default. Uploads always go to the host above. Leave empty to open the host "
"above in the Printer tab."
msgstr ""
"可选。当网页界面与 Moonraker 分开提供时，“打印机”选项卡打开的地址，例如在多实"
"例主机上，Mainsail 或 Fluidd 位于 80 端口，每台打印机的 Moonraker 位于 7125、"
"7126 等端口。请输入主机名、IP 地址或完整 URL，如果端口不是默认值，请一并输"
"入。上传始终发送到上方的主机。留空则在“打印机”选项卡中打开上方的主机。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:507
msgid "API Key / Password"
msgstr "API 密钥/密码"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:508
msgid ""
"preFlight can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field should "
"contain the API Key or the password required for authentication."
msgstr ""
"preFlight 可以将 G-Code 文件上传到打印机主机。此字段应包含 API 密钥或身份验证"
"所需的密码。"

