msgid "Preprocessing"
msgstr "预处理"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3684
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this filament profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此耗材配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code 移"
"动。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3691
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this print profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此打印配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code 移"
"动。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3698
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this printer profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此打印机配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code "
"移动。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3703
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3709
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3715
msgid "Preprocessing scripts"
msgstr "预处理脚本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3705
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this filament profile."
msgstr "此耗材配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3711
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this print profile."
msgstr "此打印配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3717
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this printer profile."
msgstr "此打印机配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3721
msgid "Printer type"
msgstr "打印机类型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3722
msgid "Type of the printer."
msgstr "打印机的类型。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3727
msgid "Printer notes"
msgstr "打印机备注"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3728
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the printer here."
msgstr "您可以在此处放置有关打印机的备注。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3736
msgid "Printer vendor"
msgstr "打印机供应商"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3737
msgid "Name of the printer vendor."
msgstr "打印机供应商的名称。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3742
msgid "Printer variant"
msgstr "打印机版本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3744
msgid ""
"Name of the printer variant. For example, the printer variants may be "
"differentiated by a nozzle diameter."
msgstr "打印机变体的版本。例如, 打印机版本可以通过喷嘴直径进行区分。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3761
msgid "Raft contact Z distance"
msgstr "筏板接触Z距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3763
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between object and raft. Ignored for soluble interface."
msgstr "物体与木筏之间的垂直距离。对于可溶解的界面忽略。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3770
msgid "Raft expansion"
msgstr "筏式膨胀"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3772
msgid "Expansion of the raft in XY plane for better stability."
msgstr "在 XY 平面上扩展筏板，以获得更好的稳定性。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3779
msgid "First layer density"
msgstr "第一层密度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3781
msgid "Density of the first raft or support layer."
msgstr "第一个筏板或支撑层的密度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3789
msgid "First layer expansion"
msgstr "第一层扩展"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3791
msgid ""
"Expansion of the first raft or support layer to improve adhesion to print "
"bed."
msgstr "扩展第一层筏板或支撑层，以提高与印刷床的附着力。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3798
msgid "Raft layers"
msgstr "筏层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3800
msgid ""
"The object will be raised by this number of layers, and support material "
"will be generated under it."
msgstr "对象将相对此层数抬高，并在其下生成支撑材料。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3808
msgid "Slice resolution"
msgstr "切片分辨率"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3809
msgid ""
"Minimum detail resolution, used to simplify the input file for speeding up "
"the slicing job and reducing memory usage. High-resolution models often "
"carry more detail than printers can render. Set to zero to disable any "
"simplification and use full resolution from input."
msgstr ""
"最小细节分辨率，用于简化输入文件以加快切片作业和减少内存使用量。高分辨率模型"
"通常携带比打印机渲染更多的细节。设置为零以禁用任何简化并使用输入的全分辨率。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3819
msgid "G-code resolution"
msgstr "G-Code 解析"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3821
msgid ""
"Maximum deviation of exported G-code paths from their full resolution "
"counterparts. Very high resolution G-code requires huge amount of RAM to "
"slice and preview, also a 3D printer may stutter not being able to process a "
"high resolution G-code in a timely manner. On the other hand, a low "
"resolution G-code will produce a low poly effect and because the G-code "
"reduction is performed at each layer independently, visible artifacts may be "
"produced."
msgstr ""
"导出 G-Code 路径与其全分辨率对应路径的最大偏差。非常高分辨率的 G-Code 需要大"
"量的 RAM 才能进行切片和预览，而且 3D 打印机可能会因无法及时处理高分辨率的 G-"
"Code 而结巴。另一方面，低分辨率 G-Code 将产生低多边形效果，并且由于 G-Code 缩"
"减在每一层独立地执行，因此可能会产生可见的伪影。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3832
msgid "Minimum travel after retraction"
msgstr "回抽最小行程"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3833
msgid ""
"Retraction is not triggered when travel moves are shorter than this length."
msgstr "当打印移动短于此长度时，不会触发回抽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3839
msgid "Retract amount before wipe"
msgstr "擦拭前的回抽量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3840
msgid ""
"With bowden extruders, it may be wise to do some amount of quick retract "
"before doing the wipe movement."
msgstr "对于远程挤出机, 在做擦拭动作之前, 做一些快速的收回可能是明智的。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3847
msgid "Extend wipe"
msgstr "延长擦拭"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3848
msgid ""
"When enabled, the wipe move continues in the same direction as the last "
"extrusion move. When disabled (default), the wipe follows the perimeter loop "
"for the duration of the move."
msgstr ""
"启用后，擦拭移动会沿最后一次挤出移动的相同方向继续。禁用时（默认），擦拭在移"
"动期间沿轮廓环进行。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3854
msgid "Wipe length"
msgstr "擦拭长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3855
msgid ""
"Length of the wipe move. When using firmware retraction or without 'Wipe "
"while retracting', the wipe will be a pure travel move (no retraction). Set "
"to 0 to use the default wipe behavior based on retraction length."
msgstr ""
"擦拭移动的长度。使用固件回抽或未启用“回抽时擦拭”时，擦拭将是纯行程移动（无回"
"抽）。设为 0 则使用基于回抽长度的默认擦拭行为。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3864
msgid "Retract on layer change"
msgstr "在图层更改时回抽"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3865
msgid "This flag enforces a retraction whenever a Z move is done."
msgstr "每当完成 Z 移动时，都会强制回抽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3870
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:908
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1128
msgid "Retraction length"
msgstr "回抽长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3871
msgid "Retraction Length"
msgstr "回抽长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3872
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered, filament is pulled back by the specified "
"amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it enters the "
"extruder)."
msgstr "触发回抽时，耗材按指定量拉回（长度在进入挤出机之前在原始耗材上测量）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3878
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:2509
msgid "Length"
msgstr "长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3879
msgid "Retraction Length (Toolchange)"
msgstr "回抽长度 (工具更换)"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3880
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered before changing tool, filament is pulled back "
"by the specified amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it "
"enters the extruder)."
msgstr ""
"在更换热头之前触发回抽时，耗材按指定量拉回（长度在进入挤出机之前在原始耗材上"
"测量）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3888
msgid "Ramping slope angle"
msgstr "斜坡角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3889
msgid "Slope of the ramp in the initial phase of the travel."
msgstr "行程初始阶段斜坡的坡度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3897
msgid "Use ramping lift"
msgstr "使用斜坡抬升"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3898
msgid ""
"Generates a ramping lift instead of lifting the extruder directly upwards. "
"The travel is split into two phases: the ramp and the standard horizontal "
"travel. This option helps reduce stringing."
msgstr ""
"生成斜坡抬升，而非将挤出机直接向上抬升。行程分为两个阶段：斜坡和标准水平行"
"程。此选项有助于减少拉丝。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3905
msgid "Maximum ramping lift"
msgstr "最大斜坡抬升"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3906
msgid ""
"Maximum lift height of the ramping lift. It may not be reached if the next "
"position is close to the old one."
msgstr "斜坡抬升的最大抬升高度。如果下一位置离原位置很近，可能达不到此高度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3915
msgid "Steeper ramp before obstacles"
msgstr "障碍前更陡的斜坡"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3916
msgid ""
"If enabled, preFlight detects obstacles along the travel path and makes the "
"slope steeper in case an obstacle might be hit during the initial phase of "
"the travel."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，preFlight 会检测行程路径上的障碍，并在行程初始阶段可能撞到障碍时使"
"坡度更陡。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3924
msgid ""
"High flow nozzles allow higher print speeds.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This value is controlled from Print Settings > Advanced > Tool "
"Configuration"
msgstr ""
"高流量喷嘴允许更高的打印速度。\n"
"\n"
"注意：此值在“打印设置 > 高级 > 工具配置”中控制"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3930
msgid "Lift height"
msgstr "抬升高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3931
msgid "Lift height applied before travel."
msgstr "行程前应用的抬升高度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3939
msgid "Above Z"
msgstr "Z 高于"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3940
msgid "Only lift Z above"
msgstr "仅提升 Z 高于"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3941
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place above the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for skipping lift on the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果将此值设置为正值，则 Z 提升将仅发生在指定的绝对 Z 上方。您可以调整此设置"
"以跳过第一个图层上的提升。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3948
msgid "Below Z"
msgstr "Z 低于"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3949
msgid "Only lift Z below"
msgstr "仅提升 Z 低于"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3950
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place below the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for limiting lift to the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果将此值设置为正值，则 Z 提升将仅发生在指定的绝对 Z 以下。您可以调整此设"
"置，将提升限制为第一个图层。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3958
msgid "Deretraction extra length"
msgstr "回抽恢复额外长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3959
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after the travel move, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament. This setting is rarely needed."
msgstr ""
"当回抽在打印后得到补偿时，挤出机将推进这个额外的耗材量。很少需要此设置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3966
msgid "Extra length on restart"
msgstr "重新启动时的额外长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3967
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after changing tool, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament."
msgstr "当更换热头后补偿回抽时，挤出机将推进这额外的耗材量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3974
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3975
msgid "Retraction Speed"
msgstr "回抽速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3976
msgid "The speed for retractions (it only applies to the extruder motor)."
msgstr "回抽速度 (仅适用于挤出机电机)。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3982
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3983
msgid "Deretraction Speed"
msgstr "减速速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3984
msgid ""
"The speed for loading of a filament into extruder after retraction (it only "
"applies to the extruder motor). If left to zero, the retraction speed is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"收回后将耗材装入挤出机的速度 (仅适用于挤出机电机)。如果保持为零, 则使用回抽速"
"度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3991
msgid "Seam gap distance"
msgstr "接缝间隙距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3992
msgid ""
"The distance between the endpoints of a closed loop perimeter. Positive "
"values will shorten and interrupt the loop slightly to reduce the seam. "
"Negative values will extend the loop, causing the endpoints to overlap "
"slightly. When percents are used, the distance is derived from the nozzle "
"diameter. Set to zero to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
"闭合环路轮廓两端点之间的距离。正值会稍微缩短并中断环路以减少接缝。负值会延长"
"环路，使两端点稍微重叠。使用百分比时，距离根据喷嘴直径推导。设为零可禁用此功"
"能。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4002
msgid "Seam position"
msgstr "接缝位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4004
msgid "Position of perimeters starting points."
msgstr "轮廓起点的位置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近的"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
#: src/DSKY/GUI/MainFrame.cpp:2026
msgid "Rear"
msgstr "后面"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4011
msgid "Staggered inner seams"
msgstr "交错内接缝"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4014
msgid ""
"This option causes the inner seams to be shifted backwards based on their "
"depth, forming a zigzag pattern."
msgstr "此选项会导致内部接缝根据其深度向后移动，从而形成Z字形图案。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4019
msgid "Seam type"
msgstr "接缝类型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4021
msgid ""
"Controls how the seam point on external perimeters is shaped to hide start/"
"stop blobs.\n"
"\n"
"Regular - No seam shaping. Standard seam behavior.\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - Creates a V-shaped channel one perimeter deep at the seam. Both "
"the start and end of the external perimeter are pushed inward, and the first "
"inner perimeter is trimmed to absorb the disturbance.\n"
"\n"
"Nip - Only the start of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The end remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"start side only.\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - Only the end of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The start remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"end side only.\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - Alternates between Nip on even layers and Tuck on odd "
"layers. This distributes the seam disturbance across both sides of the "
"junction, preventing a consistent bulge on one side.\n"
"\n"
"Note: All non-Regular modes require multiple perimeters and are not used in "
"Spiral Vase mode."
msgstr ""
"控制外轮廓上接缝点的成形方式，以隐藏起止处的瑕疵。\n"
"\n"
"常规 - 不进行接缝成形。标准接缝行为。\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - 在接缝处创建一条一条轮廓深的 V 形通道。外轮廓的起点和终点都向内"
"推，第一条内轮廓被修剪以吸收扰动。\n"
"\n"
"Nip - 接缝处只有外轮廓的起点向内推。终点保持在正常路径上。仅在起点侧修剪内轮"
"廓。\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - 接缝处只有外轮廓的终点向内推。起点保持在正常路径上。仅在终点侧修剪内轮"
"廓。\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - 在偶数层使用 Nip、奇数层使用 Tuck 之间交替。这将接缝扰动分布"
"到接合处的两侧，防止一侧出现持续的凸起。\n"
"\n"
"注意：所有非常规模式都需要多条轮廓，且不用于螺旋花瓶模式。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4037
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4432
msgid "Regular"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4038
msgid "Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Nip/Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4039
msgid "Nip"
msgstr "Nip"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4040
msgid "Tuck"
msgstr "Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4041
msgid "Alt. Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Alt. Nip/Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4044
msgid "Seam notch width"
msgstr "接缝凹槽宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4046
msgid ""
"Width of the V-shaped notch as a multiple of the external perimeter "
"extrusion width. In Nip/Tuck mode, this is the full notch width across both "
"sides of the seam. In Nip or Tuck mode, only half the width is used since "
"only one side of the seam is shaped. The depth is automatically calculated "
"from perimeter spacing. Wider values are more forgiving for blobs but create "
"a larger surface depression. Narrower values are subtler."
msgstr ""
"V 形凹槽的宽度，以外轮廓挤出宽度的倍数表示。在 Nip/Tuck 模式下，这是接缝两侧"
"的完整凹槽宽度。在 Nip 或 Tuck 模式下，由于只成形接缝的一侧，只使用一半宽度。"
"深度根据轮廓间距自动计算。较宽的值对瑕疵更宽容，但会造成更大的表面凹陷。较窄"
"的值更不易察觉。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4052
msgid "x ext. width"
msgstr "x 外轮廓宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4061
msgid "Seam notch corner threshold"
msgstr "接缝凹槽角度阈值"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4064
msgid ""
"Controls where seam notching is applied based on corner sharpness. At sharp "
"corners the seam is naturally hidden by the geometry, so notching is "
"unnecessary.\n"
"\n"
"Seams on corners sharper than this angle are skipped. The default of 44° "
"means any corner of 44° or less is considered sharp enough to hide the seam "
"on its own - just under 45°, where a clean fold already conceals the "
"junction.\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to apply seam notching everywhere regardless of corner angle."
msgstr ""
"根据拐角锐度控制接缝凹槽的应用位置。在尖锐拐角处，接缝自然被几何形状隐藏，因"
"此无需凹槽。\n"
"\n"
"比此角度更锐的拐角上的接缝会被跳过。默认 44° 表示任何 44° 或更小的拐角都被视"
"为足够尖锐，可自行隐藏接缝——略低于 45°，干净的折叠已能掩盖接合处。\n"
"\n"
"设为 0 则无论拐角角度如何都应用接缝凹槽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4078
msgid "Scarf joint placement"
msgstr "斜接接缝位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4080
msgid "Where to place scarf joint seam."
msgstr "斜接接缝放置的位置。"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4085
msgid "Nowhere"
msgstr "无处"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4087
msgid "Contours"
msgstr "轮廓"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4088
#: src/DSKY/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:131
msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "任何地方"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4091
msgid "Scarf joint only on smooth perimeters"
msgstr "仅在平滑轮廓上斜接"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4093
msgid "Only use the scarf joint when the perimeter is smooth."
msgstr "仅当轮廓平滑时使用斜接接缝。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4098
msgid "Scarf start height"
msgstr "斜接起始高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4100
msgid ""
"Start height of the scarf joint specified as fraction of the current layer "
"height."
msgstr "斜接接缝的起始高度，以当前层高的分数表示。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4108
msgid "Scarf joint around entire perimeter"
msgstr "斜接环绕整条轮廓"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4110
msgid "Extend the scarf around entire length of the perimeter."
msgstr "将斜接延伸到整条轮廓的长度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4115
msgid "Scarf joint length"
msgstr "斜接长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4117
msgid "Length of the scarf joint."
msgstr "斜接接缝的长度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4124
msgid "Max scarf joint segment length"
msgstr "最大斜接段长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4126
msgid "Maximum length of any scarf joint segment."
msgstr "任何斜接接缝段的最大长度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4133
msgid "Scarf joint on inner perimeters"
msgstr "内轮廓斜接"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4135
msgid "Use scarf joint on inner perimeters."
msgstr "在内轮廓上使用斜接接缝。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4140
msgid "Distance from brim/object"
msgstr "与裙边/物体的距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4141
msgid ""
"Distance between skirt and brim (when draft shield is not used) or objects."
msgstr "环绕和裙边之间的距离（不使用导流板时）或物体。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4147
msgid "Skirt height"
msgstr "环绕高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4148
msgid "Height of skirt expressed in layers."
msgstr "环绕的高度以层表示。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4154
msgid "Draft shield"
msgstr "风挡"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4156
msgid ""
"With draft shield active, the skirt will be printed skirt_distance from the "
"object, possibly intersecting brim.\n"
"Enabled = skirt is as tall as the highest printed object.\n"
"Limited = skirt is as tall as specified by skirt_height.\n"
"This is useful to protect an ABS or ASA print from warping and detaching "
"from print bed due to wind draft."
msgstr ""
"在拔模护罩处于活动状态时，裙子将在距离物体一定距离（可能与边缘相交）处打"
"印。\n"
"Enabled=裙子与最高的印刷品一样高。\n"
"Limited=裙摆的高度与裙摆高度相同。\n"
"这有助于保护 ABS 或 ASA 印刷品不因风的牵伸而翘曲或从打印床上脱落。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4161
msgid "Limited"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4166
msgid "Loops (minimum)"
msgstr "圈数（最小值）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4167
msgid "Skirt Loops"
msgstr "裙边圈数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4168
msgid ""
"Number of loops for the skirt. If the Minimum Extrusion Length option is "
"set, the number of loops might be greater than the one configured here. Set "
"this to zero to disable skirt completely."
msgstr ""
"裙边的循环数。如果设置了\"最小挤出长度\"选项，则循环数可能大于此处配置的循环"
"数。设置为零以完全禁用裙边。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4176
msgid "Slow down if layer print time is below"
msgstr "如果图层打印时间低于"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4177
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, print moves "
"speed will be scaled down to extend duration to this value."
msgstr ""
"如果图层打印时间估计低于此秒数，则打印移动速度将缩小以将持续时间扩展到此值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4186
msgid "Don't slow down outer walls"
msgstr "不减慢外壁"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4187
msgid ""
"If enabled, outer wall speed will not be reduced to meet the minimum layer "
"time. This prevents wall thickness variation on thin-walled parts where the "
"cooling slowdown would otherwise cause over-extrusion at reduced speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，外壁速度不会为达到最小层时间而降低。这可防止薄壁零件上的壁厚变化，"
"否则冷却减速会在降低速度时导致过挤出。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4194
msgid "Small perimeters"
msgstr "小边界"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4196
msgid ""
"Speed for perimeters no larger than the small perimeter diameter (usually "
"holes). A percentage is recommended - it will be calculated as a percentage "
"of the perimeter speed, whether set manually or calculated by auto speed. "
"Set to zero to calculate it from the filament max volumetric flow."
msgstr ""
"轮廓不大于小轮廓直径（通常是孔洞）时使用的速度。建议使用百分比 - 无论是手动设"
"置还是由自动速度计算，都会按轮廓速度的百分比计算。设为零则根据耗材的最大体积"
"流量计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4207
msgid "Small perimeter diameter"
msgstr "小轮廓直径"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4209
msgid ""
"A perimeter no longer than the circumference of a circle of this diameter is "
"a small perimeter and prints at the small perimeter speed. Set to zero to "
"never apply the small perimeter speed."
msgstr ""
"长度不超过该直径圆周长的轮廓即为小轮廓，将以小轮廓速度打印。设为零则永不应用"
"小轮廓速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4217
msgid "Solid infill threshold area"
msgstr "实心填充阈值区域"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4219
msgid ""
"Force solid infill for regions having a smaller area than the specified "
"threshold."
msgstr "对面积小于指定阈值的区域强制实心填充。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4220
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4674
msgid "mm²"
msgstr "mm²"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4226
msgid "Solid infill extruder"
msgstr "实心填充挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4228
msgid "The extruder to use when printing solid infill."
msgstr "打印实体填充时使用的挤出机。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4234
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5368
msgid "Solid infill every"
msgstr "固体填充每个"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4236
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5370
msgid ""
"This feature allows to force a solid layer every given number of layers. "
"Zero to disable. You can set this to any value (for example 9999); preFlight "
"will automatically choose the maximum possible number of layers to combine "
"according to nozzle diameter and layer height."
msgstr ""
"此功能允许每隔给定数量的图层强制生成一个实心图层。设为零可禁用。您可以将其设"
"置为任何值（例如 9999）；preFlight 将根据喷嘴直径和层高度自动选择要合并的最大"
"层数。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4249
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill for "
"solid surfaces. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置实心表面填充的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度"
"（若已设置），否则使用 1.125 倍喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据"
"“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4261
msgid ""
"Speed for printing solid regions (top/bottom/internal horizontal shells). "
"This can be expressed as a percentage (for example: 80%) over the default "
"infill speed above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"打印实体区域的速度（顶部/底部/内部水平壳体）。这可以表示为百分比（例如：80%）"
"超过上述默认填充速度。为自动设置为零。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4272
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:44
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:47
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:101
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:104
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1198
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1202
msgid "Solid layers"
msgstr "实心层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4273
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces."
msgstr "要在顶部和底部曲面上生成的实心图层数。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4279
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4280
msgid "Minimum thickness of a top / bottom shell"
msgstr "顶部/底部外壳的最小厚度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4286
msgid "Spiral vase"
msgstr "螺旋花瓶"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4287
msgid ""
"This feature will raise Z gradually while printing a single-walled object in "
"order to remove any visible seam. This option requires a single perimeter, "
"no infill, no top solid layers and no support material. You can still set "
"any number of bottom solid layers as well as skirt/brim loops. It won't work "
"when printing more than one single object."
msgstr ""
"打印单壁对象时，此功能将逐渐升高Z，以移除任何可见接缝。此选项需要单个周长、无"
"填充、无顶部实体层和无支撑材料。您仍然可以设置任意数量的底部实体层以及裙子/帽"
"檐环。当打印多个对象时，它将不起作用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4295
msgid "Temperature variation"
msgstr "温度变化"

#. TRN PrintSettings : "Ooze prevention" > "Temperature variation"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4297
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied when an extruder is not active. The "
"value is not used when 'idle_temperature' in filament settings is defined."
msgstr ""
"挤出机不活动时要应用的温度。当定义耗材设置中的 \"idle_temperature \"时，该值"
"不使用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4307
msgid "Emit temperature commands automatically"
msgstr "自动发出温度命令"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4308
msgid ""
"When enabled, preFlight will check whether your custom Start G-Code contains "
"G-codes to set extruder, bed or chamber temperature (M104, M109, M140, M190, "
"M141 and M191). If so, the temperatures will not be emitted automatically so "
"you're free to customize the order of heating commands and other custom "
"actions. Note that you can use placeholder variables for all preFlight "
"settings, so you can put a \"M109 S[first_layer_temperature]\" command "
"wherever you want.\n"
"If your custom Start G-Code does NOT contain these G-codes, preFlight will "
"execute the Start G-Code after heated chamber was set to its temperature, "
"bed reached its target temperature and extruder just started heating.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled, preFlight will NOT emit commands to heat up extruder, bed or "
"chamber, leaving all to Custom Start G-Code."
msgstr ""
"启用后，preFlight 会检查你的自定义起始 G-Code 是否包含设置挤出机、热床或腔体"
"温度的 G-code（M104、M109、M140、M190、M141 和 M191）。如果包含，则不会自动发"
"出这些温度，你可以自由定制加热指令的顺序及其他自定义操作。请注意，你可以为所"
"有 preFlight 设置使用占位符变量，因此可以把“M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]”指令放在任何位置。\n"
"如果你的自定义起始 G-Code 不包含这些 G-code，preFlight 将在加热腔体设定到其温"
"度、热床达到目标温度且挤出机刚开始加热之后执行起始 G-Code。\n"
"\n"
"禁用时，preFlight 不会发出加热挤出机、热床或腔体的指令，全部交由自定义起始 G-"
"Code 处理。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4323
msgid "Custom printer parameters"
msgstr "自定义打印机参数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4332
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4351
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:611
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:915
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:969
msgid "Start G-code"
msgstr "起始 G-Code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4333
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, possibly prepended by "
"temperature-changing commands. See 'autoemit_temperature_commands'."
msgstr ""
"该启动程序在开始时插入，可能是前置温度变化命令准备的。请参"
"阅“autoemit_temperature_commands”。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4342
msgid "Custom filament parameters"
msgstr "自定义耗材参数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4352
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, after any printer start "
"gcode (and after any toolchange to this filament in case of multi-material "
"printers). This is used to override settings for a specific filament. If "
"preFlight detects M104, M109, M140 or M190 in your custom codes, such "
"commands will not be prepended automatically so you're free to customize the "
"order of heating commands and other custom actions. Note that you can use "
"placeholder variables for all preFlight settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want. If you have multiple "
"extruders, the gcode is processed in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"此启动过程在开始、任何打印机启动 gcode 后（以及多材料打印机的情况下的任何工具"
"更换到此耗材之后）插入。这用于覆盖特定耗材的设置。如果 preFlight 在自定义代码"
"中检测到 M104、M109、M140 或 M190，则此类命令不会自动预置，因此您可以自由自定"
"义加热命令和其他自定义操作的顺序。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 "
"preFlight 设置，因此您可以将\"S[first_layer_temperature]\"命令放在任何所需的"
"位置。如果您有多个挤出机，则按挤出机顺序处理 gcode。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4368
msgid "Color change G-code"
msgstr "颜色更改 G-Code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4369
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the color change"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作颜色更改的代码"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4377
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:625
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:986
msgid "Pause Print G-code"
msgstr "暂停打印 G-Code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4378
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the pause print"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作暂停打印的代码"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4386
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:651
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:915
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:917
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:919
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:969
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:971
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:973
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:975
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:977
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:979
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:981
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:984
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:986
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:988
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:990
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1178
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1183
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:451 src/DSKY/GUI/Tab.cpp:6425
msgid "Custom G-code"
msgstr "自定义 G-Code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4387
msgid "This G-code will be used as a custom code"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作自定义代码"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4395
msgid "Single Extruder Multi Material"
msgstr "单挤出机多材料"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4396
msgid "The printer multiplexes filaments into a single hot end."
msgstr "打印机将耗材多路复用到一个热端。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4401
msgid "Prime all printing extruders"
msgstr "装填所有印刷挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4403
msgid ""
"If enabled, all printing extruders will be primed at the front edge of the "
"print bed at the start of the print."
msgstr "如果启用, 所有打印挤出机都将在打印开始时在构建板的前缘进行装填。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4408
msgid "No sparse layers (EXPERIMENTAL)"
msgstr "无稀疏层（实验）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4409
msgid ""
"If enabled, the wipe tower will not be printed on layers with no "
"toolchanges. On layers with a toolchange, extruder will travel downward to "
"print the wipe tower. User is responsible for ensuring there is no collision "
"with the print."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，擦拭塔将不会打印在没有工具更改的图层上。在更换工具的图层上，挤出机"
"将向下移动以打印擦拭塔。用户有责任确保不与打印冲突。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4416
msgid "Slice gap closing radius"
msgstr "切片间隙闭合半径"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4419
msgid ""
"Cracks smaller than 2x gap closing radius are being filled during the "
"triangle mesh slicing. The gap closing operation may reduce the final print "
"resolution, therefore it is advisable to keep the value reasonably low."
msgstr ""
"在三角形网格切片过程中，小于 2 倍间隙闭合半径的裂纹将被填充。间隙闭合操作可能"
"会降低最终打印分辨率，因此建议将值保持在合理的较低水平。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4427
msgid "Slicing Mode"
msgstr "切片模式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4430
msgid ""
"Use \"Even-odd\" for 3DLabPrint airplane models. Use \"Close holes\" to "
"close all holes in the model."
msgstr "3DLabPrint 飞机模型使用“奇偶”。使用“关闭孔”关闭模型中的所有孔。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4432
msgid "Even-odd"
msgstr "奇偶"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4432
msgid "Close holes"
msgstr "闭合孔"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4437
msgid "Generate support material"
msgstr "生成支撑材料"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4439
msgid "Enable support material generation."
msgstr "启用支撑材料生成。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4443
msgid "Auto generated supports"
msgstr "自动生成支撑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4445
msgid ""
"If checked, supports will be generated automatically based on the overhang "
"threshold value. If unchecked, supports will be generated inside the "
"\"Support Enforcer\" volumes only."
msgstr ""
"如果选中, 将根据悬垂阈值自动生成支撑。如果未选中, 则仅在 \"支撑执行器\" 空间"
"内生成支撑。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4451
msgid "XY separation between an object and its support"
msgstr "对象与其支撑之间的 XY 分离距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4453
msgid ""
"XY separation between an object and its support. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 50%), it will be calculated over external perimeter width."
msgstr ""
"对象与其支撑之间的 XY 分离距离。如果表示为百分比 (例如 50%), 则将根据外部外围"
"宽度计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4464
msgid "Pattern angle"
msgstr "模式角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4466
msgid ""
"Use this setting to rotate the support material pattern on the horizontal "
"plane."
msgstr "使用此设置可旋转水平平面上的支撑材料模式。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4474
#: src/DSKY/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:130
msgid "Support on build plate only"
msgstr "仅从打印面板支撑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4477
msgid ""
"Only generate support on the build plate. Supports that cannot grow from the "
"build plate are removed instead of resting on the object. Applies only to "
"auto-generated Snug, Grid and Organic supports and to painted Organic "
"supports. Painted Snug and Grid supports are always placed exactly where "
"painted. Baobab supports use their own \"Plant trunks on object\" setting "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"仅在打印床上生成支撑。无法从打印床生长的支撑将被删除，而不是搭在物体上。仅适"
"用于自动生成的舒适的、网格和树状支撑，以及涂绘的树状支撑。涂绘的舒适的和网格"
"支撑始终精确放置在涂绘的位置。波巴布支撑则使用其自身的\"在物体上放置树干\"设"
"置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4485
msgid "Top contact Z distance"
msgstr "顶部接触 Z 距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4487
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between object and support material interface. Setting "
"this to No gap will also prevent preFlight from using bridge flow and speed "
"for the first object layer.\n"
"\n"
"Without interface layers, only No gap or Full layer height are effective. "
"Half layer and Custom values require interface layers for precise gap "
"control."
msgstr ""
"物体与支撑材料接触面之间的垂直距离。将其设为“无间隙”还会阻止 preFlight 在物体"
"首层使用桥接流量和速度。\n"
"\n"
"没有接触层时，只有“无间隙”或“整层高”有效。半层和自定义值需要接触层才能精确控"
"制间隙。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4493
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4534
msgid "No gap"
msgstr "无间隙"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4494
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4534
msgid "Half layer height"
msgstr "半层高"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4495
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4534
msgid "Full layer height"
msgstr "整层高"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4496
#: src/luminary/toolpath/extrusion/ExtrusionRole.cpp:93
#: src/luminary/toolpath/extrusion/ExtrusionRole.cpp:136
#: src/DSKY/GUI/BedShapeDialog.cpp:109 src/DSKY/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:573
#: src/DSKY/GUI/LoadStepDialog.cpp:127
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4501
msgid "Custom top contact gap"
msgstr "自定义顶部接触间隙"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4503
msgid ""
"Custom vertical distance between object and support material interface. Only "
"used when Top contact Z distance is set to Custom. The gap is achieved by "
"adjusting interface layer heights. With very few interface layers (0-1), the "
"exact gap may be approximated."
msgstr ""
"物体与支撑材料接触面之间的自定义垂直距离。仅当顶部接触 Z 距离设为“自定义”时使"
"用。该间隙通过调整接触层高度实现。当接触层很少（0-1）时，可能近似达到所需间"
"隙。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4514
msgid "Top contact extrusion width"
msgstr "顶部接触挤出宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4516
msgid ""
"Width of extrusions for the top support interface layer, as a percentage of "
"the interface width. Lower values create thinner extrusions for easier "
"separation from the supported surface. 100% uses the full interface width.\n"
"\n"
"The actual width will never go below the layer height to prevent extrusion "
"errors.\n"
"\n"
"Without interface layers, this setting only applies when Top contact Z "
"distance is set to 0 (no gap)."
msgstr ""
"顶部支撑接触层挤出的宽度，以接触面宽度的百分比表示。值越低，挤出越细，越易于"
"与被支撑表面分离。100% 使用完整接触面宽度。\n"
"\n"
"实际宽度永远不会低于层高，以防止挤出错误。\n"
"\n"
"没有接触层时，此设置仅在顶部接触 Z 距离设为 0（无间隙）时适用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4529
msgid "Bottom contact Z distance"
msgstr "底部接触 Z 距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4531
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between the object top surface and the support "
"material interface. Options are relative to layer height to ensure proper "
"alignment when supports merge."
msgstr ""
"物体顶面与支撑材料接触面之间的垂直距离。各选项相对于层高，以确保支撑合并时正"
"确对齐。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4539
msgid "Bottom contact extrusion width"
msgstr "底部接触挤出宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4541
msgid ""
"Width of extrusions for the bottom contact layer when using half-layer gap, "
"as a percentage of the interface width. Lower values create a larger gap for "
"easier support removal. Height is always 50% of layer height; this controls "
"the width.\n"
"\n"
"The actual width will never go below the extrusion height to prevent "
"extrusion errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"使用半层间隙时底部接触层挤出的宽度，以接触面宽度的百分比表示。值越低，间隙越"
"大，越易于移除支撑。高度始终为层高的 50%；此项控制宽度。\n"
"\n"
"实际宽度永远不会低于挤出高度，以防止挤出错误。\n"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4553
msgid "Enforce support for the first"
msgstr "强制支撑前"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4555
msgid ""
"Generate support material for the specified number of layers counting from "
"bottom, regardless of whether normal support material is enabled or not and "
"regardless of any angle threshold. This is useful for getting more adhesion "
"of objects having a very thin or poor footprint on the build plate."
msgstr ""
"从底部为指定数量的图层生成支撑材料,无论是否启用了普通支撑材料,也无论角度阈值"
"如何。这对于在构建板上具有非常薄或差的封装的物体的粘附性非常有用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4560
msgid "Enforce support for the first n layers"
msgstr "强制支撑前 n 层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4566
msgid "Support material extruder"
msgstr "支撑材料挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4568
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing support material, raft and skirt (1+, 0 to "
"use the current extruder to minimize tool changes)."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料、基座和裙边时使用的挤出机 (1+,0 用于使用当前挤出机以最大限度地减"
"少工具切换)。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4578
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for support "
"material. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage (for "
"example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置支撑材料的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已"
"设置），否则使用喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的"
"百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4588
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4689
#: src/luminary/toolpath/extrusion/ExtrusionRole.cpp:132
msgid "Support material interface"
msgstr "支撑材料端口"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4591
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for support "
"interface layers. If left zero, the Support material extrusion width will be "
"used. If expressed as percentage (for example 90%) it will be computed over "
"nozzle diameter or layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to "
"nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置支撑接触面层的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用支撑材料挤出宽"
"度。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直"
"径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4601
msgid "Interface loops"
msgstr "接触面圈数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4603
msgid ""
"Cover the top contact layer of the supports with loops. Disabled by default."
msgstr "用循环盖住支架的顶层接触层。默认情况下禁用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4608
msgid "Support material interface extruder"
msgstr "支撑材料接触面挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4610
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing support material interface (1+, 0 to use "
"the current extruder to minimize tool changes). This affects raft too."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料界面时要使用的挤出机 (1+,0 用于使用当前挤出机以最大限度地减少工具"
"切换)。这也会影响基座。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4617
msgid "Top interface layers"
msgstr "顶层接口层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4619
msgid ""
"Number of solid interface layers between the support structure and the "
"object. These layers distribute the gap specified in 'Top contact Z "
"distance' - more layers allow finer gap control. With fewer layers, the "
"exact gap may not be achievable and will be approximated within safe "
"extrusion limits (25-75% of nozzle diameter per layer)."
msgstr ""
"支撑结构与物体之间的实心接触面层数。这些层分摊“顶部接触 Z 距离”中指定的间隙——"
"层数越多间隙控制越精细。层数较少时，可能无法精确达到所需间隙，将在安全挤出范"
"围内（每层为喷嘴直径的 25-75%）近似实现。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4626
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4645
msgid "0 (none)"
msgstr "0（无）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4627
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4646
msgid "1 (sparse)"
msgstr "1（稀疏）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4628
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4647
msgid "2 (moderate)"
msgstr "2（中等）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4629
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4648
msgid "3 (default)"
msgstr "3（默认）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4630
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4649
msgid "4 (dense)"
msgstr "4（密集）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4635
msgid "Bottom interface layers"
msgstr "底部界面层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4637
msgid ""
"Number of interface layers to insert between the object(s) and support "
"material. Set to -1 to use the same value as 'Top interface layers'."
msgstr ""
"在物体与支撑材料之间插入的接触面层数。设为 -1 则使用与“顶部接触面层”相同的"
"值。"

#. TRN Print Settings: "Bottom interface layers". Have to be as short as possible
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4644
msgid "Same as top"
msgstr "和上面一样"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4654
msgid "Closing radius"
msgstr "闭合半径"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4656
msgid ""
"For snug supports, the support regions will be merged using morphological "
"closing operation. Gaps smaller than the closing radius will be filled in."
msgstr ""
"对于紧贴支撑，将使用形态闭合操作合并支撑区域。小于闭合半径的间隙将被填充。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4664
msgid "Minimum support area"
msgstr "最小支撑面积"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4666
msgid ""
"Paint-on support regions smaller than this area will be filtered out. This "
"prevents accidental tiny paint specs from generating support structures.\n"
"\n"
"Reference - circle diameter to area:\n"
"• 0.5mm diameter = 0.2 mm²\n"
"• 1.0mm diameter = 0.79 mm²\n"
"• 1.5mm diameter = 1.77 mm²\n"
"• 2.0mm diameter = 3.14 mm²\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to disable filtering."
msgstr ""
"小于此面积的涂绘支撑区域将被滤除。这可防止意外的微小涂点生成支撑结构。\n"
"\n"
"参考——圆直径对应面积：\n"
"• 直径 0.5mm = 0.2 mm²\n"
"• 直径 1.0mm = 0.79 mm²\n"
"• 直径 1.5mm = 1.77 mm²\n"
"• 直径 2.0mm = 3.14 mm²\n"
"\n"
"设为 0 可禁用滤除。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4680
msgid "Interface pattern spacing"
msgstr "接触面模式间距"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4682
msgid "Spacing between interface lines. Set zero to get a solid interface."
msgstr "接触面行之间的间距。设置为零以获得实心接触面。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4691
msgid ""
"Speed for printing support material interface layers. If expressed as "
"percentage (for example 50%) it will be calculated over support material "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料接触面图层的速度。如果以百分比表示（例如 50%）它将在支撑材料速度"
"上计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4700
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "模式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4702
msgid "Pattern used to generate support material."
msgstr "用于生成支撑材料的模式。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4704
msgid "Rectilinear grid"
msgstr "直线网格"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4709
msgid "Bridge fill when \"no gap\" selected"
msgstr "选择“无间隙”时使用桥接填充"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4711
msgid ""
"When enabled, bottom surfaces use bridge infill instead of solid infill when "
"support contact distance is set to \"no gap\". Bridge infill uses slower "
"speeds and flow rates optimized for printing over air.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled (default), all bottom surfaces use solid infill when \"no "
"gap\" is selected, since the support provides a stable printing surface.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This applies to all bottom surfaces, not just areas with support "
"underneath."
msgstr ""
"启用后，当支撑接触距离设为“无间隙”时，底面使用桥接填充而非实心填充。桥接填充"
"使用为悬空打印优化的较慢速度和流量。\n"
"\n"
"禁用时（默认），选择“无间隙”时所有底面使用实心填充，因为支撑提供了稳定的打印"
"表面。\n"
"\n"
"注意：这适用于所有底面，而不仅是下方有支撑的区域。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4721
msgid "Interface pattern"
msgstr "界面模式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4723
msgid ""
"Pattern used to generate support material interface. Default pattern for non-"
"soluble support interface is Rectilinear, while default pattern for soluble "
"support interface is Concentric."
msgstr ""
"用于生成支撑材料界面的图案。非可溶性支架界面的默认模式为直线，而可溶性支架界"
"面的默认模式为同心。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4732
msgid "Pattern spacing"
msgstr "模式间距"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4734
msgid "Spacing between support material lines."
msgstr "支撑材料线之间的间距。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4743
msgid "Speed for printing support material."
msgstr "打印支撑材料的速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4750
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoCut.cpp:255
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoEmboss.cpp:2545
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4753
msgid ""
"Style and shape of the support towers for auto-generated supports. "
"Projecting the supports into a regular grid will create more stable "
"supports, while snug support towers will save material and reduce object "
"scarring. Note: This setting only affects auto-generated supports. Paint-on "
"supports specify their own type (Blocker/Snug/Grid/Organic/Baobab) and will "
"override this setting in painted regions."
msgstr ""
"自动生成支撑的支撑塔样式和形状。将支撑投影到规则网格上会产生更稳定的支撑，而"
"贴合支撑塔则节省材料并减少物体疤痕。注意：此设置仅影响自动生成的支撑。涂绘支"
"撑会指定自己的类型（阻挡/贴合/网格/有机/波巴布），并在绘制区域覆盖此设置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4758
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:82
msgid "Snug"
msgstr "舒适的"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4758
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:84
msgid "Organic"
msgstr "树状"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4758
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:85
msgid "Baobab"
msgstr "波巴布"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4764
msgid "Support alerts"
msgstr "支撑警报"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4766
msgid ""
"Analyze the stability of objects without automatic supports and report where "
"supports are needed. Turning this off skips the analysis and shortens every "
"slice."
msgstr ""
"在没有自动支撑的情况下分析物体的稳定性，并报告需要支撑的位置。关闭此选项会跳"
"过分析并缩短每次切片的时间。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4771
msgid "Overhang threshold"
msgstr "悬垂阈值"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4773
msgid ""
"Support material will not be generated for overhangs whose slope angle (90° "
"= vertical) is above the given threshold. In other words, this value "
"represent the most horizontal slope (measured from the horizontal plane) "
"that you can print without support material. Set to zero for automatic "
"detection (recommended)."
msgstr ""
"对于斜率（90°= 垂直）高于给定阈值的悬伸，不会生成支撑材料。换句话说，此值表示"
"无需支撑材料即可打印的最水平斜率（从水平平面测量）。设置为零以进行自动检测"
"（建议）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4785
msgid "With sheath around the support"
msgstr "用护套围绕支撑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4787
msgid ""
"Add a sheath (a single perimeter line) around the base support. This makes "
"the support more reliable, but also more difficult to remove."
msgstr ""
"在基础支架周围添加护套 (一条外围线)。这使得支撑更可靠, 但也更难以移除。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4793
msgid "Maximum trunk angle"
msgstr "最大树干角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4797
msgid ""
"The maximum angle of the trunks, from vertical, when they have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle to be able to have more reach."
msgstr ""
"树干的最大角度（相对于垂直方向），用于树干需要避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使"
"其更垂直、更稳定。使用较高的角度，可获得更大的延伸范围。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4805
msgid "Preferred trunk angle"
msgstr "优选的树干角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4809
msgid ""
"The preferred angle of the trunks when they do not have to avoid the model. "
"Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a higher "
"angle for trunks to merge faster."
msgstr ""
"树干的首选角度，当它们不必避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使其更垂直、更稳定。使"
"用较高的角度，可使树干更快地合并。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4817
msgid "Trunk consolidation"
msgstr "树干整合"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk consolidation"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4820
msgid ""
"Fewer, larger trunks at higher values; more, slimmer trunks at lower values. "
"A trunk is dropped when the interface it serves lies within this distance of "
"another trunk's canopy, and the support layer directly under the interface "
"bridges the difference. Set to 0 to build every trunk that serves any part "
"of the interface; values larger than the support region collapse it to a "
"single trunk where one canopy and the bridged layer can hold it."
msgstr ""
"数值越高，树干越少越粗；数值越低，树干越多越细。当树干所负责的接触面落在另一"
"树干树冠的这一距离之内时，该树干不会生成，此时接触面正下方的支撑层会跨越这段"
"差距。设为 0 可生成负责接触面任意部分的每一根树干；大于支撑区域的数值会将其收"
"拢为单根树干，由一个树冠和跨接的支撑层来承托。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4831
msgid "Canopy density"
msgstr "树冠密度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4835
msgid ""
"Density of the lightning fill inside a Baobab support's canopy. The fill "
"carries the support interface across the canopy's mouth. A higher value "
"gives the interface more to land on but uses more material and time."
msgstr ""
"波巴布支撑树冠内闪电填充的密度。填充物将支撑接触面输送到树冠开口处。较高的值"
"为接触面提供更多的落脚区域，但会消耗更多材料和时间。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4843
msgid "Maximum canopy angle"
msgstr "最大树冠角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4847
msgid ""
"The maximum angle, from vertical, at which a Baobab support's canopy tapers "
"down onto its trunk. A higher angle reaches the trunk sooner and makes a "
"shallower canopy. It is reduced automatically where a layer would grow "
"outward by more than half the support extrusion width, and where a leaning "
"trunk already spends part of that allowance."
msgstr ""
"波巴布支撑树冠向其树干收拢的最大角度（相对于垂直方向）。角度越大，越快到达树"
"干，树冠也越浅。在某一层向外扩展超过支撑挤出宽度一半的位置，以及倾斜的树干已"
"经占用部分该余量的位置，此角度会自动减小。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4857
msgid "Plant trunks on object"
msgstr "在物体上放置树干"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4861
msgid ""
"Allow trunks to land on stable top surfaces of the object instead of always "
"descending to the build plate. A surface qualifies when it is wide enough "
"for the whole foot and backed by solid material beneath it."
msgstr ""
"允许树干落在物体稳定的顶面上，而不是始终下降到打印床。当某个表面足够宽以容纳"
"整个树干底部，且其下方有实心材料支撑时，该表面才符合条件。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4866
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4951
msgid "Minimum opening"
msgstr "最小开口"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Minimum opening"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4869
msgid ""
"Trunks and branches do not route through an opening in the object narrower "
"than this, such as a screw hole or a slot in a floor, even when they would "
"fit through it with the XY separation. Such an opening counts as solid while "
"the tree looks for a way down, so it goes around it. A cavity that is closed "
"at the top, such as the inside of a cap, is not an opening and keeps its "
"support. Set to 0 to let the tree use any opening it fits through."
msgstr ""
"树干和分支不会穿过物体上比该值更窄的开口，例如螺丝孔或地板上的槽，即使加上 "
"XY 间隔后本可以穿过也是如此。树寻找向下的路径时，此类开口视为实心，因此树会绕"
"开它。顶部封闭的空腔，例如盖子内部，不算作开口，会保留其支撑。设为 0，可让树"
"使用任何它能穿过的开口。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4880
msgid "Trunk diameter"
msgstr "树干直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk diameter"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4883
msgid ""
"The diameter of the thinnest trunks. Thicker trunks are more sturdy. Trunks "
"towards the base will be thicker than this."
msgstr "最细树干的直径。较粗的树干更结实。朝向基部的树干会比这更粗。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4891
msgid "Trunk diameter angle"
msgstr "树干直径角度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk diameter angle"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4894
msgid ""
"The angle of the trunks' diameter as they gradually become thicker towards "
"the bottom. An angle of 0 will cause the trunks to have uniform thickness "
"over their length. A bit of an angle can increase stability."
msgstr ""
"树干直径的角度，随着其逐渐向底部变粗。角度为 0 会使树干在其长度上具有均匀的厚"
"度。稍带角度可以增加稳定性。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4903
msgid "Trunk distance"
msgstr "树干距离"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk distance"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4906
msgid ""
"How much interface area a single trunk gathers: seeds closer than this "
"distance share a trunk, and each canopy reaches this far from its trunk to "
"cover its share of the interface."
msgstr ""
"单根树干能汇集多大的接触面区域：距离小于此值的种子会共用一根树干，每个树冠都"
"会从其树干延伸至该距离，以覆盖其应负责的那部分接触面。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4914
msgid "Maximum branch angle"
msgstr "最大分支角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4918
msgid ""
"The maximum angle of the branches, when the branches have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle to be able to have more reach."
msgstr ""
"树枝的最大角度，当树枝要避开模型的时候。使用较低的角度，使它们更垂直，更稳"
"定。使用较高的角度，能够有更多的触角。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4927
msgid "Preferred branch angle"
msgstr "优选的分支角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4931
msgid ""
"The preferred angle of the branches, when they do not have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle for branches to merge faster."
msgstr ""
"枝条的首选角度，当它们不必避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使它们更垂直，更稳定。"
"使用较高的角度，使树枝更快地合并起来。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4940
msgid "Tip diameter"
msgstr "尖端直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Tip diameter"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4943
msgid "Branch tip diameter for organic supports."
msgstr "树状支撑物的枝梢直径。"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Minimum opening"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4954
msgid ""
"Branches do not route through an opening in the object narrower than this, "
"such as a screw hole or a slot in a floor, even when a branch would fit "
"through it with the XY separation. Such an opening counts as solid while "
"branches look for a way down, so the tree goes around it. A cavity that is "
"closed at the top, such as the inside of a cap, is not an opening and keeps "
"its support. Set to 0 to let branches use any opening they fit through."
msgstr ""
"分支不会穿过物体上比该值更窄的开口，例如螺丝孔或地板上的槽，即使加上 XY 间隔"
"后某个分支本可以穿过也是如此。分支寻找向下的路径时，此类开口视为实心，因此树"
"会绕开它。顶部封闭的空腔，例如盖子内部，不算作开口，会保留其支撑。设为 0，可"
"让分支使用任何它们能穿过的开口。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4965
msgid "Branch diameter"
msgstr "分支直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch diameter"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4968
msgid ""
"The diameter of the thinnest branches of organic support. Thicker branches "
"are more sturdy. Branches towards the base will be thicker than this."
msgstr "树状支撑的最细枝条的直径。较粗的枝条更结实。朝向基部的枝条会比这更粗。"

#. TRN PrintSettings: label of an "Organic supports" setting
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4978
msgid "Branch diameter angle"
msgstr "分支直径角度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch diameter angle"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4981
msgid ""
"The angle of the branches' diameter as they gradually become thicker towards "
"the bottom. An angle of 0 will cause the branches to have uniform thickness "
"over their length. A bit of an angle can increase stability of the organic "
"support."
msgstr ""
"枝条直径的角度，因为它们逐渐向底部变粗。角度为0会使树枝在其长度上具有均匀的厚"
"度。有点角度可以增加有机支架的稳定性。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4991
msgid "Branch diameter with double walls"
msgstr "带有双壁的分支直径"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4995
msgid ""
"Branches with area larger than the area of a circle of this diameter will be "
"printed with double walls for stability. Set this value to zero for no "
"double walls."
msgstr ""
"面积大于此直径的圆面积的枝条将被打印成双壁以保持稳定。将此值设为零表示没有双"
"壁。"

#. TRN PrintSettings: label of an "Organic supports" setting
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5008
msgid "Branch distance"
msgstr "分支距离"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch distance"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5011
msgid ""
"How far apart the branches need to be when they touch the model. Making this "
"distance small will cause the tree support to touch the model at more "
"points, causing better overhang but making support harder to remove."
msgstr ""
"当树枝接触到模型时，需要间隔多远。把这个距离变小会使树木的支撑物在更多的地方"
"接触到模型，造成更好的悬空，但使支撑物更难移除。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5018
msgid "Branch density"
msgstr "分支密度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch density"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5021
msgid ""
"Adjusts the density of the support structure used to generate the tips of "
"the branches. A higher value results in better overhangs but the supports "
"are harder to remove, thus it is recommended to enable top support "
"interfaces instead of a high branch density value if dense interfaces are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"调整用于生成枝梢的支撑结构的密度。较高的值会产生更好的悬垂，但支撑物更难移"
"除，因此，如果需要密集的界面，建议启用顶部支撑界面，而不是高枝条密度值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5033
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for layers after the first one. Set this to zero to keep "
"the first layer nozzle temperature for the entire print."
msgstr "首层之后各层的喷嘴温度。设为零可在整个打印过程中保持首层喷嘴温度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5036
msgid "Nozzle temperature"
msgstr "喷嘴温度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5042
msgid "Idle temperature"
msgstr "怠速温度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5043
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature when the tool is currently not used in multi-tool "
"setups.This is only used when 'Ooze prevention' is active in Print Settings."
msgstr ""
"在多工具设置中，当前不使用工具时的喷嘴温度。这仅在打印设置中 \"防渗 \"激活时"
"使用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5051
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:619
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:979
msgid "Tool change G-code"
msgstr "工具更改 G-Code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5053
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted before every toolchange. Placeholder variables "
"for all preFlight settings as well as {toolchange_z}, {previous_extruder} "
"and {next_extruder} can be used. When a tool-changing command which changes "
"to the correct extruder is included (such as T{next_extruder}), preFlight "
"will emit no other such command. It is therefore possible to script custom "
"behaviour both before and after the toolchange."
msgstr ""
"此自定义代码在每次工具更改之前插入。可以使用所有 preFlight 设置的占位符变量以"
"及 {toolchange_z}、{previous_extruder} 和 {next_extruder}。当包含更改为正确挤"
"出机的换刀命令时（如 T{next_extruder}），preFlight 不会发出其他此类命令。因"
"此，可以在工具更改前后编写自定义行为脚本。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5067
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill for "
"top surfaces. You may want to use thinner extrudates to fill all narrow "
"regions and get a smoother finish. If left zero, default extrusion width "
"will be used if set, otherwise nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as "
"percentage (for example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or "
"layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置顶面填充的挤出宽度。你可能希望使用更细的挤出以填满所有窄"
"区域并获得更平滑的表面。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已设置），否则使用"
"喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以"
"喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5080
msgid ""
"Speed for printing top solid layers (it only applies to the uppermost "
"external layers and not to their internal solid layers). You may want to "
"slow down this to get a nicer surface finish. This can be expressed as a "
"percentage (for example: 80%) over the solid infill speed above. Set to zero "
"for auto."
msgstr ""
"打印顶部实体图层的速度（它仅适用于最上面的外部图层，不适用于其内部实心图"
"层）。您可能需要减慢速度，以获得更好的表面光洁度。这可以表示为百分比（例如："
"80%）超过上面的固体填充速度。为自动设置为零。"

#. TRN Print Settings: "Top solid layers"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5093
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5101
msgctxt "Layers"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5095
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on top surfaces."
msgstr "要在顶部曲面上生成的实心图层数。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5096
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:44
msgid "Top solid layers"
msgstr "顶部实心层"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5103
msgid ""
"The number of top solid layers is increased above top_solid_layers if "
"necessary to satisfy minimum thickness of top shell. This is useful to "
"prevent pillowing effect when printing with variable layer height."
msgstr ""
"如果需要满足顶部外壳的最小厚度，顶部实体层的数量将增加到顶部实体层之上。这有"
"助于防止在使用可变层高打印时出现起球效应。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5106
msgid "Minimum top shell thickness"
msgstr "最小顶壳厚度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5112
msgid "Top surface flow reduction"
msgstr "顶面流量降低"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5114
msgid ""
"Reduces extrusion flow for visible top surfaces (perimeters and solid "
"infill). This helps prevent overextrusion artifacts on visible surfaces. The "
"percentage is subtracted from 100% (e.g., 3% means 97% flow). Set to 0% to "
"disable. Top solid infill always uses reduced flow when enabled; perimeters "
"use visibility detection to only reduce flow on truly visible segments."
msgstr ""
"降低可见顶面（轮廓和实心填充）的挤出流量。这有助于防止可见表面上的过挤出瑕"
"疵。该百分比从 100% 中减去（例如 3% 表示 97% 流量）。设为 0% 可禁用。启用时顶"
"部实心填充始终使用降低的流量；轮廓使用可见性检测，仅在真正可见的段上降低流"
"量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5128
msgid ""
"Controls how precisely the boundary between visible and hidden perimeter "
"segments is detected. Higher precision means more accurate boundaries but "
"slower slicing.\n"
"\n"
"• Precise (1mm): Highest accuracy, samples every 1mm along perimeters\n"
"• Standard (2mm): Good balance of accuracy and speed (recommended)\n"
"• Relaxed (4mm): Faster slicing with slightly less precise boundaries\n"
"• Minimal (8mm): Fastest, may miss some visibility transitions"
msgstr ""
"控制可见与隐藏轮廓段之间边界的检测精度。精度越高，边界越准确，但切片越慢。\n"
"\n"
"• 精确（1mm）：精度最高，沿轮廓每 1mm 采样一次\n"
"• 标准（2mm）：精度与速度的良好平衡（推荐）\n"
"• 宽松（4mm）：切片更快，边界略不精确\n"
"• 最低（8mm）：最快，可能漏掉一些可见性转变"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5135
msgid "Precise (1mm)"
msgstr "精确（1mm）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5136
msgid "Standard (2mm)"
msgstr "标准（2mm）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5137
msgid "Relaxed (4mm)"
msgstr "宽松（4mm）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5138
msgid "Minimal (8mm)"
msgstr "最低（8mm）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5144
msgid "Merge top solid infills"
msgstr "合并顶部实心填充"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5146
msgid ""
"When enabled, top solid infills will be merged with adjacent internal solid "
"infills to improve print efficiency. WARNING: On certain objects, this "
"feature may incorrectly convert solid infill into top solid infill, or cause "
"slight misalignment of top surface patterns. Disable if precise top surface "
"alignment is critical."
msgstr ""
"启用后，顶部实心填充将与相邻的内部实心填充合并以提高打印效率。警告：在某些物"
"体上，此功能可能错误地将实心填充转换为顶部实心填充，或导致顶面图案轻微错位。"
"如果精确的顶面对齐至关重要，请禁用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5154
msgid "Narrow to Athena"
msgstr "窄区转 Athena"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5156
msgid ""
"Replace zigzag patterns in narrow solid infill areas with Athena variable-"
"width fill. Athena generates clean adaptive-width paths that follow the "
"contour of narrow regions without zigzags or tight loop artifacts. Areas "
"narrower than the Narrow threshold will be converted. Applies to internal "
"solid, top solid, and bottom solid infill. Does not affect bridge infill."
msgstr ""
"用 Athena 可变宽度填充替换窄实心填充区域中的锯齿图案。Athena 生成沿窄区域轮廓"
"的干净自适应宽度路径，没有锯齿或紧密环路瑕疵。窄于“窄区阈值”的区域将被转换。"
"适用于内部实心、顶部实心和底部实心填充。不影响桥接填充。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5165
msgid "Narrow threshold"
msgstr "窄区阈值"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5167
msgid ""
"Solid infill areas (internal, top, and bottom) narrower than this many "
"extrusion widths will use Athena variable-width fill instead of the "
"configured fill pattern. Only applies when 'Narrow to Athena' is enabled."
msgstr ""
"窄于此挤出宽度倍数的实心填充区域（内部、顶部和底部）将使用 Athena 可变宽度填"
"充，而非配置的填充图案。仅在启用“窄区转 Athena”时适用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5170
msgid "x extrusion width"
msgstr "x 挤出宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5177
msgid "Narrow to Athena on top/bottom"
msgstr "顶面/底面窄区转 Athena"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5179
msgid ""
"Also apply Narrow to Athena to top and bottom solid surfaces, not only "
"internal solid. Thin areas of these visible surfaces convert to a smooth "
"Athena bead instead of the configured pattern, while wider areas keep it. "
"Only applies when 'Narrow to Athena' is enabled."
msgstr ""
"将\"窄区转 Athena\"也应用于顶面和底面实心区域，而不仅限于内部实心。这些可见面"
"的细窄区域将转换为平滑的 Athena 挤出线，而非配置的图案；较宽区域保持不变。仅"
"在启用\"窄区转 Athena\"时生效。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5187
msgid "Speed for travel moves (jumps between distant extrusion points)."
msgstr "打印移动的速度（在远处挤出点之间跳跃）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5195
msgid "Z travel"
msgstr "行程"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5196
msgid ""
"Speed for movements along the Z axis.\n"
"When set to zero, the value is ignored and regular travel speed is used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"沿 Z 轴移动的速度。\n"
"当设置为零时，该值将被忽略，而使用常规行驶速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5204
msgid "Use firmware retraction"
msgstr "使用固件回抽"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5205
msgid ""
"This setting uses G10 and G11 commands to have the firmware handle the "
"retraction. Note that this has to be supported by firmware."
msgstr "此设置使用 G10 和 G11 指令让固件处理回抽。请注意，这需要固件支持。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5211
msgid "Use relative E distances"
msgstr "使用相对 E 距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5212
msgid ""
"If your firmware requires relative E values, check this, otherwise leave it "
"unchecked. Most firmwares use absolute values."
msgstr ""
"如果您的固件需要相对的 E 值，请检查这一点，否则不要选中它。大多数固件使用绝对"
"值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5218
msgid "Use volumetric E"
msgstr "使用体积 E"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5219
msgid ""
"This experimental setting outputs the E values in cubic millimeters instead "
"of linear millimeters. If your firmware doesn't already know filament "
"diameter(s), you can put commands like 'M200 D[filament_diameter_0] T0' in "
"your start G-code in order to turn volumetric mode on and use the filament "
"diameter of the filament selected in preFlight. The firmware must support "
"volumetric extrusion: Marlin and RepRapFirmware do, Klipper does not."
msgstr ""
"此实验设置输出以立方毫米为单位的 E 值，而不是线性毫米。如果您的固件尚不知道耗"
"材直径，您可以在起始 G-Code 中输入类似 'M200 D[filament_diameter_0] T0' 的命"
"令，以打开体积模式并使用在 preFlight 中选择的耗材直径。固件必须支持体积挤出："
"Marlin 和 RepRapFirmware 支持，Klipper 不支持。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5229
msgid "Machine hourly rate"
msgstr "机器小时费率"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5230
msgid ""
"Hourly operating cost of this printer. Combined with filament cost to "
"calculate total job cost."
msgstr "此打印机的每小时运行成本。与耗材成本结合以计算作业总成本。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5231
msgid "/h"
msgstr "/小时"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5237
msgid "Currency symbol"
msgstr "货币符号"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5238
msgid "Currency symbol displayed with cost estimates (e.g. $, EUR, GBP)."
msgstr "与成本估算一同显示的货币符号（例如 $、EUR、GBP）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5243
msgid "Enable variable layer height feature"
msgstr "启用可变图层高度特征"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5244
msgid ""
"Some printers or printer setups may have difficulties printing with a "
"variable layer height. Enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"某些打印机或打印机设置在打印图层高度可变时可能遇到问题。默认情况下启用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5250
msgid "Prefer clockwise movements"
msgstr "优先顺时针移动"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5251
msgid ""
"This setting makes the printer print loops clockwise instead of "
"counterclockwise."
msgstr "此设置使打印机以顺时针而非逆时针打印环路。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5256
msgid "Combine Z into first travel"
msgstr "将 Z 轴合并到首次行程"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5257
msgid ""
"Merges the first Z move and XY move into a single XYZ travel at the start of "
"a print and after each tool change that occurs at a layer change. Warning: "
"this changes how your machine approaches the print bed. Only enable it if "
"your start and tool-change G-code leave the nozzle raised."
msgstr ""
"将首个 Z 移动和 XY 移动合并为单次 XYZ 行程，用于打印开始时，以及每次在图层更"
"改时发生的工具更改之后。警告: 这会改变您的机器接近打印热床的方式。仅当您的起"
"始 G-Code 和工具更改 G-Code 使喷嘴保持抬起状态时才启用此选项。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5264
msgid "Wipe while retracting"
msgstr "回抽时擦拭"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5265
msgid ""
"This flag will move the nozzle while retracting to minimize the possible "
"blob on leaky extruders."
msgstr "此标志将在回抽时移动喷嘴，以尽量减少泄漏挤出器上可能出现的斑点。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5272
msgid ""
"Multi material printers may need to prime or purge extruders on tool "
"changes. Extrude the excess material into the wipe tower."
msgstr ""
"多材料打印机可能需要对工具更换进行填充清洗或清除挤出机。将多余的材料挤出到擦"
"料塔中。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5278
msgid "Purging volumes - matrix"
msgstr "清除量-矩阵"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5279
msgid ""
"This matrix describes volumes (in cubic milimetres) required to purge the "
"new filament on the wipe tower for any given pair of tools."
msgstr ""
"此矩阵描述清除擦料塔上任何给定工具对的新耗材所需的体积（以立方米为单位）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5291
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoCut.cpp:261 src/DSKY/GUI/ThumbnailsDialog.cpp:143
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5292
msgid "Width of a wipe tower"
msgstr "擦料塔的宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5298
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5299
msgid "Wipe tower brim width"
msgstr "擦拭塔裙边宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5306
msgid "Stabilization cone apex angle"
msgstr "稳定锥顶角"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5307
msgid ""
"Angle at the apex of the cone that is used to stabilize the wipe tower. "
"Larger angle means wider base."
msgstr "锥体顶端的角度，用于稳定擦拭塔。角度越大意味着底座越宽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5316
msgid "Wipe tower purge lines spacing"
msgstr "擦拭塔清洗线的间距"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5317
msgid "Spacing of purge lines on the wipe tower."
msgstr "擦拭塔上的清洗线的间距。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5325
msgid "Extra flow for purging"
msgstr "清料额外流量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5327
msgid ""
"Extra flow used for the purging lines on the wipe tower. This makes the "
"purging lines thicker or narrower than they normally would be. The spacing "
"is adjusted automatically."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔上清料线所用的额外流量。这会使清料线比通常更粗或更细。间距会自动调整。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5336
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5344
msgid "Wipe options"
msgstr "擦除选项"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5337
msgid "Wipe into this object's infill"
msgstr "擦入此物体的填充"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5338
msgid ""
"Purging after toolchange will be done inside this object's infills. This "
"lowers the amount of waste but may result in longer print time  due to "
"additional travel moves."
msgstr ""
"工具更改后的清除将在该对象的填充内完成。这降低了浪费量，但由于额外的行程移"
"动，可能会导致更长的打印时间。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5345
msgid "Wipe into this object"
msgstr "擦除到此对象"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5346
msgid ""
"Object will be used to purge the nozzle after a toolchange to save material "
"that would otherwise end up in the wipe tower and decrease print time. "
"Colours of the objects will be mixed as a result."
msgstr ""
"对象将用于在工具更改后清除喷嘴, 以节省在擦料塔中浪费的材料并减少打印时间。因"
"此, 对象的颜色将混合在一起。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5352
msgid "Maximal bridging distance"
msgstr "最大桥接距离"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5353
msgid "Maximal distance between supports on sparse infill sections."
msgstr "稀疏填充部分上支撑之间的最大距离。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5359
msgid "Wipe tower extruder"
msgstr "擦拭塔挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5361
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing perimeter of the wipe tower. Set to 0 to "
"use the one that is available (non-soluble would be preferred)."
msgstr ""
"打印擦拭塔轮廓时使用的挤出机。设为 0 则使用可用的挤出机（优先非可溶性）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5380
msgid "XY Size Compensation"
msgstr "XY 尺寸补偿"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5382
msgid ""
"The object will be grown/shrunk in the XY plane by the configured value "
"(negative = inwards, positive = outwards). This might be useful for fine-"
"tuning hole sizes."
msgstr ""
"对象将在 XY 平面中按配置的值（负 = 向内、正 = 向外）进行增长/收缩。这对于微调"
"孔大小可能很有用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5390
msgid "Z offset"
msgstr "Z 偏移"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5391
msgid ""
"This value will be added (or subtracted) from all the Z coordinates in the "
"output G-code. It is used to compensate for bad Z endstop position: for "
"example, if your endstop zero actually leaves the nozzle 0.3mm far from the "
"print bed, set this to -0.3 (or fix your endstop)."
msgstr ""
"此值将从输出 G-Code 中的所有 Z 坐标中添加(或减去)。它用于补偿损坏的 Z 端限位"
"器置：例如，如果限位器零实际离开喷嘴 0.3mm 远离构建板(打印床)，将其设置为 "
"-0.3（或调整限位器）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5400
msgid "Perimeter generator"
msgstr "轮廓生成器"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5403
msgid ""
"Athena (Precise) produces precise perimeters with exact user-specified "
"widths for maximum dimensional accuracy. Arachne (Variable) produces "
"perimeters with variable extrusion width for better handling of thin walls "
"and complex details. This setting also affects the Concentric infill."
msgstr ""
"Athena（精确）生成精确的轮廓，宽度严格按用户指定，以获得最大尺寸精度。Arachne"
"（可变）生成挤出宽度可变的轮廓，更好地处理薄壁和复杂细节。此设置也影响同心填"
"充。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5407
msgid "Athena (Precise)"
msgstr "Athena（精确）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5408
msgid "Arachne (Variable)"
msgstr "Arachne（可变）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5413
msgid "Perimeter transition length"
msgstr "轮廓过渡长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5416
msgid ""
"When transitioning between different numbers of perimeters as the part "
"becomes thinner, a certain amount of space is allotted to split or join the "
"perimeter segments. If expressed as a percentage (for example 100%), it will "
"be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"当随着零件变薄而在不同数量的轮廓之间过渡时，会分配出一定的空间来分割或连接轮"
"廓段。如果用百分比表示（例如 100%），它将根据喷嘴直径计算出来。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5425
msgid "Perimeter transition filter margin"
msgstr "轮廓过渡过滤裕量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5428
msgid ""
"Prevent transitioning back and forth between one extra perimeter and one "
"less. This margin extends the range of extrusion widths which follow to "
"[Minimum perimeter width - margin, 2 * Minimum perimeter width + margin]. "
"Increasing this margin reduces the number of transitions, which reduces the "
"number of extrusion starts/stops and travel time. However, large extrusion "
"width variation can lead to under- or overextrusion problems. If expressed "
"as a percentage (for example 25%), it will be computed based on the nozzle "
"diameter."
msgstr ""
"防止在多一个轮廓和少一个轮廓之间来回过渡。这个余量将挤压宽度的范围扩大到 [最"
"小轮廓宽度-余量, 2*最小轮廓宽度+余量]。增加这个余量可以减少转换的次数，从而减"
"少挤压开始/停止的次数和移动时间。然而，大的挤出宽度变化会导致挤出不足或过度挤"
"出的问题。如果用百分比表示（例如25%），将根据喷嘴直径计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5441
msgid "Perimeter transition angle"
msgstr "轮廓过渡角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5443
msgid ""
"When to create transitions between even and odd numbers of perimeters. A "
"wedge shape with an angle greater than this setting will not have "
"transitions and no perimeters will be printed in the center to fill the "
"remaining space. Reducing this setting reduces the number and length of "
"these center perimeters, but may leave gaps or overextrude."
msgstr ""
"何时在偶数和奇数轮廓之间创建过渡。 角度大于此设置的楔形将没有过渡，并且不会在"
"中心打印轮廓以填充剩余空间。 减少此设置会减少这些中心轮廓的数量和长度，但可能"
"会留下间隙或过度拉伸。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5454
msgid "Perimeter distribution count"
msgstr "轮廓分布计数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5456
msgid ""
"The number of perimeters, counted from the center, over which the variation "
"needs to be spread. Lower values mean that the outer perimeters don't change "
"in width."
msgstr ""
"从中心开始计算的轮廓数量，变化需要在这些轮廓上展开。较低的值意味着外部轮廓的"
"宽度不发生变化。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5463
msgid "Minimum feature size"
msgstr "最小特征尺寸"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5466
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness of thin features. Model features thinner than this value "
"are not generated. If expressed as a percentage (for example 25%), it will "
"be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"薄特征的最小厚度。比此值更薄的模型特征不会生成。若以百分比表示（例如 25%），"
"将根据喷嘴直径计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5474
msgid "Minimum wall length"
msgstr "最小壁长度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5477
msgid ""
"A single thin wall (an unpaired bead between two features) shorter than this "
"is not printed. Expressed as a percentage, it is measured against that "
"wall's own width; the default of 50% keeps every wall longer than half its "
"width. Raise it to drop the short stubs that drain nozzle pressure before a "
"longer wall. The first and topmost layers keep the default so their surfaces "
"do not open gaps."
msgstr ""
"短于此值的单条薄壁(两个特征之间未配对的挤出线)不会被打印。以百分比表示，它是"
"相对于该壁自身的宽度来测量的；默认值 50% 会保留所有长度超过其宽度一半的壁。提"
"高此值可去除在更长的壁之前消耗喷嘴压力的短小残段。首层和顶层保持默认值，以避"
"免其表面出现缝隙。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5486
msgid "Minimum perimeter width"
msgstr "最小轮廓宽度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5489
msgid ""
"Width of the perimeter that will replace thin features (according to the "
"Minimum feature size) of the model. If the Minimum perimeter width is "
"thinner than the thickness of the feature, the perimeter will become as "
"thick as the feature itself. If expressed as a percentage (for example 85%), "
"it will be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"将替换模型的细特征（根据最小特征尺寸）的轮廓宽度。 如果最小轮廓宽度小于特征的"
"厚度，则轮廓将变得与特征本身一样厚。 如果以百分比表示（例如 85%），它将根据喷"
"嘴直径计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6480
