msgstr "切片模型并导出工具路径为 G-Code。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6836
msgid "Align XY"
msgstr "对齐 XY"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6837
msgid "Align the model to the given point."
msgstr "将模型与给定点对齐。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6841
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoCut.cpp:1436
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Widgets/TextInput.cpp:261
msgid "Cut"
msgstr "剪切"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6842
msgid "Cut model at the given Z."
msgstr "在给定的 Z 处切割模型。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6846
#: src/DSKY/GUI/ArrangeSettingsDialogImgui.cpp:100
msgid "Center"
msgstr "居中"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6847
msgid "Center the print around the given center."
msgstr "将打印居中，以给定的中心为中心。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6851
msgid "Don't arrange"
msgstr "不自动布局"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6852
msgid ""
"Do not rearrange the given models before merging and keep their original XY "
"coordinates."
msgstr "在合并之前，不要重新布局给定的模型并保留其原始 XY 坐标。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6855
msgid "Ensure on bed"
msgstr "确保在床上"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6857
msgid ""
"Lift the object above the bed when it is partially below. Enabled by "
"default, use --no-ensure-on-bed to disable."
msgstr ""
"当物体部分位于床下方时，将其抬到床上方。默认情况下，使用 --no-sure-on-bed 禁"
"用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6861
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "复制"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6862
msgid "Multiply copies by this factor."
msgstr "生成乘以此数量的副本。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6866
msgid "Duplicate by grid"
msgstr "按网格复制"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6867
msgid "Multiply copies by creating a grid."
msgstr "通过创建网格来创建副本。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6870
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:643 src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:2547
msgid "Merge"
msgstr "合并"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6872
msgid ""
"Arrange the supplied models in a plate and merge them in a single model in "
"order to perform actions once."
msgstr ""
"将提供的模型排列在一个板中，并将它们合并到单个模型中，以便执行一次操作。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6876
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoAlign.cpp:2020
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoRotate.cpp:612
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:790
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:836
msgid "Rotate"
msgstr "旋转"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6877
msgid "Rotation angle around the Z axis in degrees."
msgstr "围绕 Z 轴的旋转角度（以度表示）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6881
msgid "Rotate around X"
msgstr "围绕 X 旋转"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6882
msgid "Rotation angle around the X axis in degrees."
msgstr "围绕 X 轴的旋转角度（以度表示）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6886
msgid "Rotate around Y"
msgstr "围绕 Y 旋转"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6887
msgid "Rotation angle around the Y axis in degrees."
msgstr "围绕 Y 轴的旋转角度（以度表示）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6891
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:208
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:1560
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoScale.cpp:128
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:288
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:791
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:806
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:825
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:837
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "比例"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6892
msgid "Scaling factor or percentage."
msgstr "缩放因子或百分比。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6896
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:860 src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:891
msgid "Split"
msgstr "分裂"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6897
msgid ""
"Detect unconnected parts in the given model(s) and split them into separate "
"objects."
msgstr "检测给定模型中的未连接部件，并将它们拆分为单独的对象。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6900
msgid "Scale to Fit"
msgstr "缩放至合适"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6901
msgid "Scale to fit the given volume."
msgstr "缩放以适合给定的空间。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6910
msgid "Ignore non-existent config files"
msgstr "忽略不存在的配置文件"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6911
msgid "Do not fail if a file supplied to --load does not exist."
msgstr "如果提供给 --load 的文件不存在，不会报错失败。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6915
msgid ""
"Forward-compatibility rule when loading configurations from config files and "
"project files (3MF, AMF)."
msgstr "从配置文件和项目文件（3MF、AMF）加载配置时的转发兼容性规则。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6917
msgid ""
"This version of preFlight may not understand configurations produced by the "
"newest preFlight versions. For example, newer preFlight may extend the list "
"of supported firmware flavors. One may decide to bail out or to substitute "
"an unknown value with a default silently or verbosely."
msgstr ""
"此版本的 preFlight 可能无法理解最新 preFlight 版本生成的配置。例如，较新的 "
"preFlight 可能会扩展支持的固件版本列表。人们可能会决定退出，或者用默认值悄悄"
"地或详细地替换未知值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6922
msgid "Bail out on unknown configuration values"
msgstr "对未知的配置值进行保护"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6923
msgid ""
"Enable reading unknown configuration values by verbosely substituting them "
"with defaults."
msgstr "通过用默认值详细替换未知配置值来启用读取。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6925
msgid ""
"Enable reading unknown configuration values by silently substituting them "
"with defaults."
msgstr "通过用默认值替换未知配置值来启用读取。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6930
msgid "Output File"
msgstr "输出文件"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6932
msgid ""
"The file where the output will be written (if not specified, it will be "
"based on the input file)."
msgstr "将写入输出的文件（如果未指定，则基于输入文件）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6936
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6938
msgid ""
"Load and store settings at the given directory. This is useful for "
"maintaining different profiles or including configurations from a network "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"在给定目录加载和存储设置。这对于维护不同的配置文件或包括网络存储中的配置非常"
"有用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6941
msgid "Maximum number of threads"
msgstr "最大线程数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6943
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of threads the slicing process will use. If not "
"defined, it will be decided automatically."
msgstr "设置切片过程使用的最大线程数。如未定义，将自动决定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6947
msgid "Logging level"
msgstr "日志级别"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6948
msgid ""
"Sets logging sensitivity. 0:fatal, 1:error, 2:warning, 3:info, 4:debug, "
"5:trace\n"
"For example. loglevel=2 logs fatal, error and warning level messages."
msgstr ""
"设置日志敏感度。0:致命、1:错误、2:警告、3:信息、4:调试、5:跟踪\n"
"例如。loglevel=2 记录致命、错误和警告级别的消息。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:6971
msgid "Debug output categories"
msgstr "调试输出类别"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7006
msgid "Automatic OpenGL antialiasing samples number selection"
msgstr "自动选择 OpenGL 抗锯齿采样数"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7007
msgid ""
"Automatically select the highest number of samples for OpenGL antialiasing."
msgstr "自动为 OpenGL 抗锯齿选择最高的采样数。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7013
msgid "OpenGL version"
msgstr "OpenGL版本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7014
msgid "Select a specific version of OpenGL"
msgstr "选择OpenGL的特定版本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7019
msgid "OpenGL compatibility profile"
msgstr "OpenGL 兼容性配置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7020
msgid "Enable OpenGL compatibility profile"
msgstr "启用 OpenGL 兼容性配置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7025
msgid "OpenGL debug output"
msgstr "OpenGL调试输出"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7026
msgid ""
"Activate OpenGL debug output on graphic cards which support it (OpenGL 4.3 "
"or higher)"
msgstr "在支持的显卡上激活 OpenGL 调试输出（OpenGL 4.3 或更高）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7032
msgid "Single instance mode"
msgstr "单实例模式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7033
msgid ""
"If enabled, the command line arguments are sent to an existing instance of "
"GUI preFlight, or an existing preFlight window is activated. Overrides the "
"\"single_instance\" configuration value from application preferences."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，命令行参数将发送到 GUI preFlight 的现有实例，或者激活现有的 "
"preFlight 窗口。覆盖应用程序首选项中的“单实例”配置值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7038
msgid "Delete files after loading"
msgstr "加载后删除文件"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7039
msgid "Delete files after loading."
msgstr "加载后删除文件。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7043
msgid "Render with a software renderer"
msgstr "使用软件渲染器渲染"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7045
msgid ""
"Render with a software renderer. The bundled MESA software renderer is "
"loaded instead of the default OpenGL driver."
msgstr ""
"使用软件渲染器进行渲染。加载捆绑的 MESA 软件呈现器,而不是默认的 OpenGL 驱动程"
"序。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7073
msgid "Current z-hop"
msgstr "当前 z-hop"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7074
msgid "Contains z-hop present at the beginning of the custom G-code block."
msgstr "包含自定义 G-code 块开头处的 z-hop。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7082
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:265
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GUI_ObjectManipulation.cpp:752
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7084
msgid ""
"Position of the extruder at the beginning of the custom G-code block. If the "
"custom G-code travels somewhere else, it should write to this variable so "
"preFlight knows where it travels from when it gets control back."
msgstr ""
"自定义 G-code 块开头处挤出机的位置。如果自定义 G-code 移动到别处，应写入此变"
"量，以便 preFlight 在重新获得控制权时知道从何处行进。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7088
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:887
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:889
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:891
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:893
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:895
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:897
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:899
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:901
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:903
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:905
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Tab.cpp:2717
msgid "Retraction"
msgstr "回抽"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7090
msgid ""
"Retraction state at the beginning of the custom G-code block. If the custom "
"G-code moves the extruder axis, it should write to this variable so "
"preFlight deretracts correctly when it gets control back."
msgstr ""
"自定义 G-code 块开头处的回抽状态。如果自定义 G-code 移动了挤出机轴，应写入此"
"变量，以便 preFlight 在重新获得控制权时正确回抽恢复。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7094
msgid "Extra deretraction"
msgstr "额外回抽恢复"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7095
msgid "Currently planned extra extruder priming after deretraction."
msgstr "当前计划在回抽恢复后进行的额外挤出机预挤。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7098
msgid "Absolute E position"
msgstr "绝对 E 位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7099
msgid ""
"Current position of the extruder axis. Only used with absolute extruder "
"addressing."
msgstr "挤出机轴的当前位置。仅在绝对挤出机寻址时使用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7107
msgid "Current extruder"
msgstr "当前挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7108
msgid "Zero-based index of currently used extruder."
msgstr "当前所用挤出机的从零开始的索引。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7111
msgid "Current object index"
msgstr "当前物体索引"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7112
msgid ""
"Specific for sequential printing. Zero-based index of currently printed "
"object."
msgstr "专用于顺序打印。当前打印物体的从零开始的索引。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7115
msgid "Has single extruder MM priming"
msgstr "是否有单挤出机 MM 预挤"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7116
msgid "Are the extra multi-material priming regions used in this print?"
msgstr "此打印中是否使用了额外的多材料预挤区域？"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7119
msgid "Has wipe tower"
msgstr "是否有擦拭塔"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7120
msgid "Whether or not wipe tower is being generated in the print."
msgstr "打印中是否正在生成擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7123
msgid "Initial extruder"
msgstr "初始挤出机"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7124
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the first extruder used in the print. Same as "
"initial_tool."
msgstr "打印中使用的第一个挤出机的从零开始的索引。与 initial_tool 相同。"

#. TRN: Meaning 'filament type of the initial filament'
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7128
msgid "Initial filament type"
msgstr "初始耗材类型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7129
msgid "String containing filament type of the first used extruder."
msgstr "包含第一个所用挤出机耗材类型的字符串。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7132
msgid "Initial tool"
msgstr "初始工具"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7133
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the first extruder used in the print. Same as "
"initial_extruder."
msgstr "打印中使用的第一个挤出机的从零开始的索引。与 initial_extruder 相同。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7136
msgid "Is extruder used?"
msgstr "挤出机是否被使用？"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7137
msgid ""
"Vector of booleans stating whether a given extruder is used in the print."
msgstr "表明给定挤出机是否在打印中被使用的布尔值向量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7145
msgid "Volume per extruder"
msgstr "每挤出机体积"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7146
msgid "Total filament volume extruded per extruder during the entire print."
msgstr "整个打印过程中每个挤出机挤出的耗材总体积。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7149
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7157
msgid "Print time (normal mode)"
msgstr "打印时间（正常模式）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7150
msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as print_time."
msgstr "以正常模式（即非静音模式）打印时的估计打印时间。与 print_time 相同。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7153
msgid "Number of printing extruders"
msgstr "打印挤出机数量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7154
msgid "Number of extruders used during the print."
msgstr "打印过程中使用的挤出机数量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7159
msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as normal_print_time."
msgstr ""
"以正常模式（即非静音模式）打印时的估计打印时间。与 normal_print_time 相同。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7162
msgid "Used filament types"
msgstr "已用耗材类型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7163
msgid "Comma-separated list of all filament types used during the print."
msgstr "打印过程中使用的所有耗材类型的逗号分隔列表。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7166
msgid "Print time (silent mode)"
msgstr "打印时间（静音模式）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7167
msgid "Estimated print time when printed in silent mode."
msgstr "以静音模式打印时的估计打印时间。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7170
msgid "Total cost"
msgstr "总成本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7171
msgid ""
"Total cost of all material used in the print. Calculated from cost in "
"Filament Settings."
msgstr "打印中使用的所有材料的总成本。根据耗材设置中的成本计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7174
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7203
msgid "Total weight"
msgstr "总重量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7175
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7204
msgid ""
"Total weight of the print. Calculated from density in Filament Settings."
msgstr "打印件的总重量。根据耗材设置中的密度计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7178
msgid "Total wipe tower cost"
msgstr "擦拭塔总成本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7179
msgid ""
"Total cost of the material wasted on the wipe tower. Calculated from cost in "
"Filament Settings."
msgstr "擦拭塔上浪费材料的总成本。根据耗材设置中的成本计算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7182
msgid "Wipe tower volume"
msgstr "擦拭塔体积"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7183
msgid "Total filament volume extruded on the wipe tower."
msgstr "擦拭塔上挤出的耗材总体积。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7186
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3767 src/DSKY/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3769
#: src/DSKY/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:4176
msgid "Used filament"
msgstr "消耗耗材"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7187
msgid "Total length of filament used in the print."
msgstr "打印中使用的耗材总长度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7190
msgid "Total number of toolchanges"
