#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1199
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces. These layers "
"provide a finished appearance and structural support for the printed object."
msgstr "在顶面和底面生成的实心层数。这些层为打印物体提供精致的外观和结构支撑。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1201
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness (in mm) of top and bottom shells. The layer count will be "
"automatically increased if needed to meet this thickness, which helps "
"prevent pillowing on top surfaces when using variable layer heights."
msgstr ""
"顶壳和底壳的最小厚度（mm）。如有需要，层数将自动增加以达到此厚度，这有助于在"
"使用可变层高时防止顶面凹陷。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1203
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and visible surfaces. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互锁轮廓与可见表面之间的实心层数。确保互锁图案完全隐藏在物体内部。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1400
msgid "Available with at least one perimeter."
msgstr "至少有一个轮廓时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1403
msgid ""
"Available with at least one perimeter and a seam type other than Regular."
msgstr "至少有一个轮廓，且接缝类型不为一般时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1406
msgid "Available when dynamic overhang speeds are enabled."
msgstr "启用动态悬挑速度后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1408
msgid "Available with a fill density above 0%."
msgstr "填充密度大于 0% 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1411
msgid "Available with infill, when automatic infill combination is disabled."
msgstr "有填充，且自动填充合并已关闭时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1414
msgid "Available with infill, when automatic infill combination is enabled."
msgstr "有填充，且自动填充合并已开启时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1417
msgid "Available with infill and a maximum infill anchor length above 0."
msgstr "有填充，且填充锚点的最大长度大于 0 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1419
msgid "Available with top or bottom solid layers."
msgstr "有顶部或底部实心层时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1421
msgid "Available with infill or solid layers."
msgstr "有填充或实心层时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1423
msgid "Available when Narrow to Athena is enabled."
msgstr "启用\"窄区转 Athena\"后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1431
msgid ""
"Available with top solid layers and Ensure vertical shell thickness, without "
"spiral vase."
msgstr "有顶部实心层和\"确保垂直壳层厚度\"时可用（不使用螺旋花瓶）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1439
msgid ""
"Available with bottom solid layers and Ensure vertical shell thickness, "
"without spiral vase."
msgstr "有底部实心层和\"确保垂直壳层厚度\"时可用（不使用螺旋花瓶）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1441
msgid ""
"Disabled while Auto speed is active; it sets this speed from the maximum "
"print speed and the volumetric flow."
msgstr "自动速度启用时不可用；自动速度会根据最大打印速度和体积流量计算此速度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1444
msgid "Available with top solid layers, while Auto speed is not active."
msgstr "有顶部实心层，且自动速度未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1447
msgid ""
"Available with support material and interface layers, while Auto speed is "
"not active."
msgstr "有带接口层的支撑材料，且自动速度未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1450
msgid "Available with a fuzzy skin noise type other than Classic."
msgstr "模糊表皮噪声类型不为 Classic 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1453
msgid "Available with the Perlin, Billow or Ridged fuzzy skin noise."
msgstr "使用 Perlin、Billow 或 Ridged 模糊表皮噪声时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1456
msgid "Available with the Perlin or Billow fuzzy skin noise."
msgstr "使用 Perlin 或 Billow 模糊表皮噪声时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1458
msgid "Disabled while Spiral vase is active."
msgstr "螺旋花瓶启用时不可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1460
msgid "Available when Serpentine is enabled."
msgstr "启用 Serpentine 后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1463
msgid "Available when Serpentine and relaxed spacing are enabled."
msgstr "启用 Serpentine 和宽松间距后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1465
msgid "Available when Serpentine is enabled and relaxed spacing is disabled."
msgstr "启用 Serpentine 且关闭宽松间距后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1468
msgid ""
"Available when Serpentine and its depth limit are enabled and relaxed "
"spacing is disabled."
msgstr "启用 Serpentine 及其深度限制，且关闭宽松间距后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1471
msgid ""
"Available when Serpentine is enabled and relaxed spacing and the outer loop "
"are disabled; the outer loop aligns the ridges itself."
msgstr ""
"启用 Serpentine，且关闭宽松间距和外表面环圈后可用；外表面环圈会自行对齐脊线。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1474
msgid "Available when interlocking perimeters are enabled."
msgstr "启用互锁轮廓后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1477
msgid "Available with a top surface flow reduction above 0%."
msgstr "顶面流量降低大于 0% 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1479
msgid "Available with top solid layers."
msgstr "有顶部实心层时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1482
msgid ""
"Available with a default acceleration above 0; at 0 the firmware's "
"acceleration is left alone."
msgstr "默认加速度大于 0 时可用；为 0 时固件的加速度保持不变。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1483
msgid "Available with at least one skirt loop."
msgstr "至少有一圈环绕时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1486
msgid ""
"Available with a skirt, while the draft shield is not enabled; an enabled "
"draft shield sets the height itself."
msgstr "有环绕，且风挡未启用时可用；启用的风挡会自行设置高度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1489
msgid "Available when support material or a raft is enabled."
msgstr "启用支撑材料或基座后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1491
msgid ""
"Available when supports are generated automatically; painted supports carry "
"this in the paint."
msgstr "支撑自动生成时可用；绘制的支撑会在绘制中携带此设置。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1498
msgid "Available with supports and a custom top contact Z distance."
msgstr "有支撑和自定义顶部接触 Z 距离时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1505
msgid "Available with supports and a half-layer bottom contact Z distance."
msgstr "有支撑和半层底部接触 Z 距离时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1507
msgid ""
"Available when support material is enabled or support enforcers are painted."
msgstr "启用支撑材料或绘制了支撑生成器后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1509
msgid "Available with support material and interface layers."
msgstr "有带接口层的支撑材料时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1511
msgid "Available when support material, a raft or a skirt is enabled."
msgstr "启用支撑材料、基座或环绕后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1513
msgid "Available with raft layers and a top contact Z distance above 0."
msgstr "有基座层和大于 0 的顶部接触 Z 距离时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1514
msgid "Available with at least one raft layer."
msgstr "至少有一层基座时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1516
msgid "Available when ironing is enabled."
msgstr "启用熨烫后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1518
msgid "Available when ooze prevention is enabled."
msgstr "启用 Ooze 预防后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1520
msgid "Available when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr "启用擦料塔后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1523
msgid ""
"Disabled while Avoid crossing perimeters is active; the two are exclusive."
msgstr "\"避免跨越轮廓边界\"启用时不可用；两者互斥。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1526
msgid ""
"Disabled while Avoid crossing curled overhangs is active; the two are "
"exclusive."
msgstr "\"避免穿越卷曲的悬垂物\"启用时不可用；两者互斥。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1529
msgid "Available when Avoid crossing perimeters is enabled."
msgstr "启用\"避免跨越轮廓边界\"后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1532
msgid "Available with the Arachne or Athena perimeter generator."
msgstr "使用 Arachne 或 Athena 轮廓生成器时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1534
msgid ""
"Available with the Arachne perimeter generator; Athena keeps its widths "
"fixed."
msgstr "使用 Arachne 轮廓生成器时可用；Athena 会保持其宽度固定。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1536
msgid "Available with the Athena perimeter generator."
msgstr "使用 Athena 轮廓生成器时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1543
msgid ""
"Available with a scarf seam placement other than Nowhere, without spiral "
"vase."
msgstr "斜接接缝位置不为无处时可用（不使用螺旋花瓶）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1545
msgid "Available when interlocking beams are enabled."
msgstr "启用梁互锁后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1547
msgid ""
"Disabled while interlocking beams are active; they replace the segmented "
"regions."
msgstr "梁互锁启用时不可用；它会替代分段区域。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1550
msgid ""
"Available with a segmented region width above 0, while interlocking beams "
"are not active."
msgstr "分段区域宽度大于 0，且梁互锁未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1553
msgid ""
"Disabled while manual fan speeds are active; they set the fan per feature."
msgstr "手动风扇转速启用时不可用；它会按元素设置风扇。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1555
msgid "Available when automatic cooling is enabled."
msgstr "启用自动冷却后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1558
msgid ""
"Available when automatic cooling or the fan always on is enabled, while "
"manual fan speeds are not active."
msgstr "启用自动冷却或风扇常开，且手动风扇转速未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1561
msgid "Available when manual fan speeds are enabled."
msgstr "启用手动风扇转速后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1564
msgid ""
"Available when dynamic fan speeds are enabled, while manual fan speeds are "
"not active."
msgstr "启用动态风扇速度，且手动风扇转速未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1573
msgid ""
"Available when automatic cooling uses the Consistent surface slowdown logic."
msgstr "自动冷却使用\"一致表面\"减速逻辑时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1576
msgid "Available when multitool ramming is enabled."
msgstr "启用多工具回填后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1579
msgid "Available when pressure advance is enabled for this filament."
msgstr "为该耗材启用压力提前后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1582
msgid "Available with more than one extruder."
msgstr "有多于一个挤出机时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1584
msgid "Available with a Marlin firmware flavor."
msgstr "使用 Marlin 固件类型时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1586
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, for the time estimate or "
"emitted to G-code."
msgstr "使用中的机器限制用于时间估算或输出到 G-code 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1588
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, with a Marlin firmware flavor; "
"only Marlin has minimum feedrates."
msgstr ""
"使用中的机器限制为 Marlin 固件类型时可用；只有 Marlin 具有最小进给速度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1596
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, with a firmware that has a "
"travel acceleration (Marlin 2, RepRapFirmware, Rapid)."
msgstr ""
"使用中的机器限制搭配具有移动加速度的固件（Marlin 2、RepRapFirmware、Rapid）时"
"可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1599
msgid ""
"Disabled while firmware retraction is active; the firmware performs the "
"retraction itself."
msgstr "固件回抽启用时不可用；固件会自行执行回抽。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1601
msgid "Disabled while ramping lift is active; it replaces the fixed lift."
msgstr "斜坡抬升启用时不可用；它会替代固定抬升。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1603
msgid "Available when ramping lift is enabled."
msgstr "启用斜坡抬升后可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1605
msgid "Available with a retraction length above 0 or firmware retraction."
msgstr "回抽长度大于 0 或启用固件回抽时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1612
msgid ""
"Available with a lift: a retract lift above 0, or ramping lift with a "
"maximum lift above 0."
msgstr "有抬升时可用：抬升高度大于 0，或带有大于 0 的最大斜坡抬升的斜坡抬升。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1614
msgid ""
"Available with a retraction length above 0, while firmware retraction is not "
"active."
msgstr "回抽长度大于 0，且固件回抽未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1616
msgid ""
"Available when wipe while retracting is enabled, while firmware retraction "
"is not active."
msgstr "启用\"回抽时擦拭\"，且固件回抽未启用时可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1619
msgid ""
"Available with more than one extruder and a retraction length above 0 when "
"the tool is disabled."
msgstr "有多于一个挤出机，且工具禁用时回抽长度大于 0 时可用。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:228
msgid "Generating perimeters"
msgstr "生成轮廓"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:366
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"Serpentine generated %1% region(s) with ordinary walls because the pattern "
"could not be hosted there (too thin or too intricate). Review the External "
"perimeter paths in Preview."
msgstr ""
"由于图案过薄或过于复杂，无法容纳在该区域内，蛇形以普通壁生成了 %1% 个区域。请"
"在预览中检查外部边界路径。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:392
#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:540
msgid "Preparing infill"
msgstr "准备填充"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:658
msgid "Making infill"
msgstr "制作填充物"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:762
msgid "Searching support spots"
msgstr "搜索支撑点"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:813
msgid "Generating support material"
msgstr "生成支撑材料"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:852
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"An extrusion width of %1% mm (%2%%% of the nozzle diameter) exceeds the "
"width warning maximum of %3%%%, at z = %4% mm."
msgstr ""
"挤出宽度 %1% mm(喷嘴直径的 %2%%%)超过了宽度警告上限 %3%%%，位于 z = %4% mm "
"处。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:877
msgid "Estimating curled extrusions"
msgstr "估计卷曲挤出"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/object/PrintObject.cpp:930
msgid "Calculating overhanging perimeters"
msgstr "正在计算悬垂轮廓"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:531
msgid ""
"Draft shield is enabled but Skirt loops is 0, so no draft shield is printed."
msgstr "风挡已启用，但裙边圈数为 0，因此不会打印风挡。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:643
msgid "All objects are outside of the print volume."
msgstr "所有对象都在打印范围之外。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:646
msgid "The supplied settings will cause an empty print."
msgstr "当前提供的设置将导致空打印。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:686
msgid ""
"Auto speed requires every filament to have a Max volumetric flow set. Check "
"your Filament Settings."
msgstr "自动速度要求每种耗材都设置最大体积流量。请检查耗材设置。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:698
msgid "Ironing speed cannot be 0. Set an explicit speed or disable ironing."
msgstr "熨烫速度不能为 0。请设置明确的速度或禁用熨烫。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:705
msgid ""
"Avoid crossing perimeters option and avoid crossing curled overhangs option "
"cannot be both enabled together."
msgstr "避免穿越边界选项和避免穿越弯曲的悬臂选项不能同时启用。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:715
msgid ""
"Only a single object may be printed at a time in Spiral Vase mode. Either "
"remove all but the last object, or enable sequential mode by "
"\"complete_objects\"."
msgstr ""
"在螺旋花瓶模式下，一次只能打印一个对象。移除除最后一个对象外的所有对象，或通"
"过“完成对象”启用顺序模式。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:719
msgid ""
"The Spiral Vase option can only be used when printing single material "
"objects."
msgstr "螺旋花瓶选项只能在打印单个材质对象时使用。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:724
msgid ""
"With absolute extruder addressing, Spiral Vase mode does not taper its first "
"and last layer and does not blend layers in XY. Enable \"Use relative E "
"distances\" in Printer Settings to get both, if your firmware supports it."
msgstr ""
"在使用绝对挤出机寻址时，螺旋花瓶模式不会对首尾层进行锥化处理，也不会在 XY 方"
"向混合层。如果您的固件支持，请在打印机设置中启用\"使用相对 E 距离\"以同时获得"
"这两种效果。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:730
msgid ""
"Machine limits cannot be emitted to G-Code when Klipper firmware flavor is "
"used. Change the value of machine_limits_usage."
msgstr ""
"当使用Klipper固件风格时，机器限制不能发送到G-Code。更改machine_limits_usage的"
"值。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:766
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, it exceeds the maximum "
"build volume height because of material shrinkage compensation."
msgstr "物体 %1% 本身在打印空间内，但由于材料收缩补偿，超出了最大打印高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:772
#, boost-format
msgid "The object %1% exceeds the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "对象%1%超过了最大构建体积高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:780
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, its last layer exceeds "
"the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "虽然对象%1%本身符合构建体积，但其最后一层超过了最大构建体积高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:784
msgid ""
"You might want to reduce the size of your model or change current print "
"settings and retry."
msgstr "您可能希望缩小模型的大小，或者更改当前打印设置，然后重试。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:836
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"Variable layer height regions thicker than %1% mm are not supported with the "
"current support settings."
msgstr "厚度超过 %1% mm 的可变层高区域在当前支撑设置下不受支持。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:861
msgid ""
"The wipe tower is only supported if all extruders use filaments of the same "
"diameter."
msgstr "仅当所有挤出机使用相同直径的耗材时，才支持擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:870
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported for the oozeBot Rapid, Marlin, "
"Klipper, RepRap/Sprinter, RepRapFirmware and Repetier G-code flavors."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔目前仅支持 oozeBot Rapid、Marlin、Klipper、RepRap/Sprinter、"
"RepRapFirmware 和 Repetier G-code 风格。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:873
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported with the relative extruder "
"addressing (use_relative_e_distances=1)."
msgstr "擦料塔目前仅支持相对挤出机寻址 (use_relative_e_distances=1)。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:876
msgid ""
"Ooze prevention is only supported with the wipe tower when "
"'single_extruder_multi_material' is off."
msgstr "只有当'single_extruder_multi_material'关闭时，擦拭塔才支持防渗。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:878
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower currently does not support volumetric E (use_volumetric_e=0)."
msgstr "擦拭塔目前不支持体积E（使用体积E=0）。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:880
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently not supported for multimaterial sequential "
"prints."
msgstr "擦拭塔目前不支持多材质连续打印。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:894
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is not supported when supports are combined with variable "
"layer height."
msgstr "当支撑与可变层高结合使用时，不支持擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:908
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they have equal "
"layer heights"
msgstr "仅当多个对象具有相等的图层高度时,才支持擦料塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:911
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are printed "
"over an equal number of raft layers"
msgstr "只有在相同数量的基座层上打印的对象时, 才支持擦料塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:915
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are printed "
"with the same support_material_contact_distance"
msgstr ""
"只有在使用相同的 support_material_contact_distance（支撑材料距离）打印多个对"
"象时, 才支持擦料塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:917
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are sliced "
"equally."
msgstr "只有在多个对象被平均切割的情况下, 才支持擦料塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:950
msgid ""
"The Wipe tower is only supported if all objects have the same variable layer "
"height"
msgstr "只有当所有对象具有相同的可变层高度时，才支持擦拭塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:984
#, boost-format
msgid "%1%=%2% mm is too low to be printable at a layer height %3% mm"
msgstr "%1%=%2%mm 太低，在图层高度 %3%mm 时无法打印"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:991
#, boost-format
msgid "Excessive %1%=%2% mm to be printable with a nozzle diameter %3% mm"
msgstr "过量 %1%=%2%mm 可打印，使用喷嘴直径 %3%mm"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1023
#: src/DSKY/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:690
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower currently supports the non-soluble supports only if they are "
"printed with the current extruder without triggering a tool change. (both "
"support_material_extruder and support_material_interface_extruder need to be "
